-- QuestLocFlavor (generado 2026-10-17): objetivos completos, con dialogos, solo para narrar.
_G.QuestLocFlavor = _G.QuestLocFlavor or {}
QuestLocFlavor[7] = {
[3500]={"Kishâtu has asked you to gather various plants nearby in Urash Dâr.","Collect red wild-flowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Returned to Kishâtu with the various plants","Collected yellow wild-flowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kishâtu has asked for your help gathering various plants she needs from the area.","Collect yellow wild-flowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bayas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Kishâtu with the plants you have collected for her.","Return to Kishâtu with the plants","'Greetings ${CLASS}.\
\
'If you are willing, I could use your help as we are running low on some of our supplies here.\
\
'I am in need of some red and yellow wild-flowers, as well as some berries. You can find the wild-flowers nearby, but you may find berries along the river's edge.'","recoge bayas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collecting Necessities","'Ah, you have returned, and it appears with the plants that I requested.'\
\
You hand the plants to Kishâtu.\
\
'Thank you, ${CLASS}. These will be put to good use'","Collected red wild-flowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3501]={"Collecting Reeds","Sûlmur has offered to show you how to make papyrus. First, you must harvest some reeds.","Collected papyrus reeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Go into the marsh to the south-west and collect some reeds. Look for reeds with good, strong stalks. Bring them back here when you are done, and do not forget to watch for crocodiles!'","You have collected papyrus reeds. You should return to Sûlmur near the barn at Mehêtur.","Bring the papyrus reeds to Sûlmur","'Yes, those look perfect! I will take them. Good work.'","Collect papyrus reeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Papyrus reeds can be found in the marsh near Mehêtur in Ambarûl.","'Would you like to learn how papyrus is made? I have not seen the wood pulp paper used in the West, but I have heard about it. They say the surface is very smooth, but it tears easily and is not as long-lasting. Papyrus sheets are strong and durable. We also have more reeds than trees.'\
\
She laughs and you get the impression that she truly enjoys her work.\
\
'The first thing you need to make papyrus sheets is papyrus the plant. Go into the marsh to the south-west and collect some reeds. Look for reeds with good, strong stalks. Bring them back here when you are done, and do not forget to watch for crocodiles!'"},
[3502]={"'If you are willing to search for the swords, perhaps you would be willing to go to Sûr Zugub as well? It is the home of sand-sifters; nasty things. I have never been there myself, but it is said that an entire Ordâkhai troop was lost there. Travellers claim to have seen the metal of their shields glinting in the sun, but none have dared enter the valley, lest they meet the same fate as the soldiers.\
\
'If you can handle the sand-sifters, collecting those shields should recover quite a bit of metal I can work with. And speaking honestly, the more of those sand-sifters you can slay while you're there, the better. Sûr Zugub is to the south-east of here.'","You have collected metal shields and defeated sand-sifters. You should return to Western Khanâg to give the shields to Sigênik.","Defeated sand-sifters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sigênik, a craftsman in Western Khanâg, has told you his plan to reuse the metal from lost shields in Sûr Zugub. He would also like you to slay sand-sifters while you are there.","Defeat sand-sifters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collecting Scraps","Bring the metal shields to Sigênik in Western Khanâg","Collect metal shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected metal shields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sigênik's eyes widen at the sight of the metal shields you have brought him.\
\
'${PLAYER}, these are wonderful! And you defeated many sand-sifters as well? Truly, you a a gift to Khûd Zagin. You have my thanks.'","Sigênik has asked you to travel to Sûr Zugub, south-east of Western Khanâg, and collect any abandoned metal shields you find. He would also like you to slay the resident sand-sifters while you're there."},
[3504]={"'¿Ya has encontrado ese corte de carne de alce? Las ciervas jóvenes pastan normalmente en busca de manzanas caídas en la vieja arboleda justo al norte de aquí.'","Carne de alce obtenida","Hal Gamyi se encuentra en el centro de Avenal.\
\
Nibs Redondo te ha pedido que hables con Hal Gamyi sobre los lobos.","Consigue carne de alce","Las ciervas jóvenes se encuentran pastando en la vieja arboleda justo al norte del centro de Avenal.\
\
Hal Gamyi te ha sugerido que caces algunos alces para conseguir cebo para los lobos, y luego vuelvas con él.","'Hal debería estar en el centro de Avenal, búscale allí.'","Lleva la carne de alce a Hal Gamyi","Consiguiendo el cebo","Tu descubrimiento de los lobos en sus camppos ha preocupado a Nibs Redondo.","'Rebaños de alces han llegado desde las fronteras del norte, cada día más y más. Tienen que estar huyendo de algo... muchos de ellos están asustados hasta el punto de que no puedo ni preparar mi arco antes de que se pierdan en la maleza.\
\
'Son los alces los que han hecho a los lobos cruzar el Brandivino. He visto a un gran lobo blanco acechando a los alces en los bosques al norte de aquí, pero huyó en cuanto me vio.\
\
'He intentado dar caza a los lobos, pero son más listos que los demás animales. Creo que tendrás que terminar con ese gran lobo para dispersar a la manada. Si los lobos están cazando alces, pienso que un buen corte de su carne podría atraer al líder.\
\
Un rebaño de ciervas jóvenes pasta normalmente en la vieja arboleda al norte de Avenal. Deberías intentar conseguir la carne de alce allí.'","'Todo esto es como una de esas viejas historias que cuenta Hal Gamyi. La mayoría de los hobbits de por aquí no escuchan mucho de lo que dice. Creo que ha pasado demasiadas noches durmiendo al raso, y eso podría jugarle malas pasadas a cualquier hobbit decente.\
\
'Aunque toda esta charla me ha hecho pensar... deberías ir a ver a Hal y contarle lo de estos lobos. Quizá sepa algo. No hace ni dos semanas que vino a mi casa y me contó que había visto a un lobo gigante al noreste de Avenal.\
\
'¿Quizá podrías hablar con él? Le encontrarás cerca del centro del pueblo.'","'¿Ya has encontrado la carne, ${PLAYER}?"},
[3505]={"Has dejado caer el tronco","'Un esfuerzo digno de recuerdo, ${PLAYER}. Recordaremos tus proezas de hoy y hablaremos de ellas en este aserradero por mucho tiempo. Toma esta recompensa bien merecida. ¡Has hecho que tú y todos los leñadores se sientan orgullosos este día!'","Pasa por los duodécimos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los novenos marcadores con el tronco","¡Vamos!","Has terminado en primer lugar en el evento de leñadores de Combe","Has terminado en segundo lugar en el evento de leñadores de Combe","Lleva el tronco hasta las siguientes marcas rojas.","Lleva el tronco hasta las últimas marcas azules para completar la carrera.","Primero tienes que conseguir un hacha para poder cortar leña y luego curar las pieles. Date prisa.","Pasa por los undécimos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los octavos marcadores con el tronco","Has llevado el tronco a través del evento de leñadores","Pasa por los décimos marcadores con el tronco","Pilas de madera refinadas (${NUMBER}/5)","Vuelve con la jueza para reclamar tu premio","Cura pieles en los tensores de competencia (${NUMBER}/5)","Con las pieles listas, ahora debes dirigirte al banco junto a la casa y probar tres cervezas de tabernas locales.","Pasa por los quintos marcadores con el tronco","No te inscribiste con la jueza antes de que comenzara el evento","La Competencia de Leñadores del bosque de Chet está reclutando; los participantes anteriores fueron retirados","'Estamos muy emocionados por ofrecer estos concursos. Estoy seguro de que mi padre y el viejo Bauman verán el mérito de esta idea. Gracias por pensar en participar.'","Cambiaste de forma y fuiste ${PLAYERNAME:descalificado[m]|descalificada[f]}","Dirígete a la mesa de competencia bajo el árbol en el centro del campamento y refina madera con el hacha de leñador.","Pasa por los segundos marcadores con el tronco","Has obtenido un hacha de leñador (${NUMBER}/1)","Has decidido competir en un certamen para determinar al mejor leñador de todo el bosque de Chet — ahora mismo. Habla con la jueza para informarle que estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para competir.","Pasa por los terceros marcadores con el tronco","Vuelve ante el juez y cuéntale tus esfuerzos en el evento.","Lleva el tronco a través del primer conjunto de marcadores en el aserradero del bosque de Chet.","'¿Otro participante?\
\
'Me alegra mucho ver que hay tanta gente interesada en la noble profesión de los leñadores. Te he apuntado en mi registro.'\
\
Ella se ríe entre dientes.\
\
'Ahora, veamos quién más quiere inscribirse. Quédate cerca y te avisaré cuando sea el momento de empezar.'","'Hmm, permíteme un momento para revisar esto.'\
\
Se detiene.\
\
'Es aceptable. Ahora, ve detrás de la casa de mi padre y despelleja los osos allí. Cuando hayas recogido cinco pieles, ve a curarlas y tráeme los objetos resultantes.'","El campamento maderero de Combe organiza un concurso de fuerza, destreza y resistencia para coronar al ganador de una codiciada competencia de leñadores.","Con esas sabrosas bebidas agitándose en tu estómago, comienza la verdadera prueba. Recoge un tronco.","Con las pieles recogidas, es momento de continuar con el curtido. Ve al muro de piedra al otro lado del campamento y cura pieles en los tensores.","Decidiste ocultarte y fuiste ${PLAYERNAME:descalificado[m]|descalificada[f]}","Recoge pieles sin refinar de las carcasas de osos detrás de la choza de Bauman (${NUMBER}/5)","Pieles sin refinar recogidas (${NUMBER}/5)","Todos los participantes están presentes y la jueza se prepara para iniciar la competencia. Espera a que dé la señal.","Ahora que ya te has inscrito en el evento, tendrás que esperar en el almacén de madera del Bosque de Chet a que se unan otros competidores.","Pieles curadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/5)","No dejes caer el tronco","Combe: Soy un Leñador","La Competencia de Leñadores del Bosque de Chet no parece estar reclutando","Espera a que la jueza dé la señal","Entrega la madera refinada a Aldith","'Apresúrate ahora. Refina las pieles en los tensores de piel al otro lado del campamento.'","'Hola, ¿has venido a participar en el concurso?'\
\
Wilkin sonríe ampliamente.\
\
'¿Qué concurso, preguntas? ¡El que determina quién es el mejor guardabosques del bosque de Chet, por supuesto! Naturalmente, para participar es necesario ser guardabosques de profesión.'\
\
'Aldith y yo pensamos que sería una buena forma de zanjar la cuestión de quién es el mejor, ya que ustedes, los guardabosques, siempre parece que estáis discutiendo sobre ello mientras tomáis una pinta de cerveza.\
\
'Para zanjar la cuestión de forma adecuada con hechos y no solo con alardes, debe ser un concurso de fuerza, destreza e incluso fortaleza de los guardabosques que compiten. Y luego tiene que haber premios para los ganadores y los que compiten, como es de esperar.\
\
'Si crees que estás a la altura del desafío, o al menos te gustan los premios, ¡solo tienes que decírmelo! Entonces tendrás que ver a Aldith para inscribirte, y en poco tiempo podremos empezar.'","Recoge un tronco para cargar durante el evento","Pasa por los séptimos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los primeros marcadores con el tronco","<rgb=#FF0000>Fallo: Los saqueadores no pueden ocultarse o serán descalificados</rgb>","Pasa por los sextos marcadores con el tronco","Pasa por los cuartos marcadores con el tronco","'¿Ya recogiste la madera? Si es así, ve a refinarla y luego muéstrame tu trabajo.'","Has refinado la madera exitosamente. Ahora recoge pieles de las carcasas de osos detrás de la choza de Bauman.","Recoge un hacha de leñador de la mesa de competencia","La competencia está a punto de comenzar","Inscríbete en la competencia hablando con la jueza","Recoge pilas de madera sin refinar (${NUMBER}/5)","Madera sin refinar recogida (${NUMBER}/5)","Bebidas consumidas (${NUMBER}/3)","Los montones de madera junto a la choza del viejo Bauman están listos para recolectarse. Toma tu hacha y recoge cinco pilas de madera sin refinar.","Te has inscrito en la competencia de leñadores de Combe","Refina pilas de madera en la mesa de competencia (${NUMBER}/5)","Marcas superadas","Estás cargando un tronco","Prueba tres bebidas de las tabernas locales (${NUMBER}/3)","<rgb=#FF0000>Fallo: No te inscribiste con la jueza</rgb>","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Estoy muy impresionado con tu destreza, y tú también deberías estarlo. Puedes volver cuando quieras y entretener a la multitud.'","Entrega las pieles refinadas y el hacha a Aldith","Espera a que otros se inscriban en la competencia","Lleva el tronco a través de las marcas azules","<rgb=#FF0000>Fallo: Los Beórnidas no pueden cambiar entre forma humana y de oso o serán descalificados</rgb>","'Sí, sí, parece que al menos manejas con cierta habilidad el cuchillo de desuello y el tensor de pieles. ¡Pasemos a la siguiente parte de la competencia: la prueba de fortaleza y resistencia!'\
\
Ella sonríe ampliamente.\
\
'Prueba las bebidas de la mesa junto a la casa de mi padre y luego recoge un tronco. Llévalo a través de las banderas rojas alrededor del campamento y termina en las banderas azules.\
\
'¡El primero en llegar será declarado ganador!'"},
[3506]={"'Wonderful work, assistant! With all sixteen of those flyers posted in high-visibility areas with great foot traffic throughout the Upper Ward, my next show is sure to be an even bigger success than my previous one! My upcoming success burns like a fire, bright and hot, and I have myself to thank for that!\
\
'And you too, of course. You have contributed a small portion, I suppose.'","You have placed a number of Ezôti's flyers. That is enough, and you should burn the rest in a fire.","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Instead of distributing more flyers for Ezôti, you have decided to burn them in a fire. The open flame on the south-eastern corner of the Grand Market in the Upper Ward should suffice.","'As excellent as I am, I am but one man... and that one man can only be in one place... at one time!\
\
'If only I could walk the whole of the city to spread word of my show, the docks themselves would buckle beneath the weight of my vast audience! But no... residents of the lower streets of the city do not have the coins I need to make the show worth my time! We will focus our efforts upon the Upper Ward only. Take these posters, and place them upon the walls of the Upper Ward. Only the denizens of such a prestigious quarter have the refined taste to appreciate my talents. And their coin purses often shine with gold instead of silver....'\
\
You resolve to place the posters in areas with poor visibility and little foot traffic. Ezôti does not deserve to be rewarded with large crowds.","Throw the remaining flyers into a fire on the south-eastern corner of the Grand Market","Hang up flyers... but place them poorly (${NUMBER}/16)","You have no more flyers left to place. Will Ezôti wonder how you accomplished the task so quickly? Probably not.","Does Ezôti need so many flyers posted?","Ezôti has asked you to place flyers advertising his show all around the Upper Ward.\
\
But because Ezôti is terrible, do not do a good job. Place flyers in poorly visible spots around the Upper Ward.","Come One, Come All!","Talk to Ezôti in the Upper Ward","Placed flyers poorly (${NUMBER}/16)","And there they go!","You decide you have posted enough flyers. Might as well burn the rest"},
[3509]={"Deliver the beeswax to Gairil","Set the lantern onto the river","Collect beeswax from hives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Limael's Vineyard is located to the north-west of Celondim.\
\
You can find beeswax from the hives near the vineyard's entrance.","'The time has flown by, hasn't it? It seems I became lost in my work. But you have come at a most opportune time.\
\
'Let me explain: I craft lanterns for those who have sailed West, so that their lights may shine in Middle-earth again for just a while. Their loved ones come to send the lanterns downstream. If they cannot journey here, I place the lanterns into the river myself.\
\
'Alas, I am running out of beeswax for my candles. I would gather more from the beehives near the entrance to Limael's Vineyard, but I have many lanterns to create. If you could aid me, I would be most grateful.'","Gairil is working at the Celondim docks to the south.\
\
You should bring the beeswax to him.","Gairil has given you one of the lanterns he crafted earlier.\
\
You should set the lantern down onto the river.","While creating lanterns for his fellow Elves, Gairil the lantern-maker has run out of candle materials and needs help collecting more.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","'Many thanks! This will be more than enough for now.\
\
'Take this lantern and send it on its way westward down the river. You've helped my kinsmen pay their respects, and I believe you have earned it.'","Coming Home","Collected beeswax from hives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3510]={"Saeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp, south of the road to Tâl Methedras.\
\
Huwela told you of a path she found leading up Methedras and instructed you to bring the information to Saeradan.","'${PLAYER}, word has come via craban from one of the Boar-clan scouts who are aiding us in this accursed place. Huwela reports that she may have found the witch your Ranger-friends seek...this Old Woman of the Mountain.\
\
'Huwela awaits you near the road to Tâl Methedras to the north. I thank you for your aid here, but soon I fear we must escape back to our own lands. We have taken too many losses here.\
\
'May fortune go with you, my friend.'","'You should speak with Huwela on the road to Tâl Methedras.'","Talk to Saeradan at the Rohirrim scout-camp","Talk to Huwela near the road to Tâl Methedras","Coming to a Conclusion","'It is well that you have come, Duvodiad. It is known among my people that the Old Woman of the Mountain is called such because she dwells upon the heights of the mountain you call Methedras, but we have never known the way to her abode...she always came down among us.\
\
'I have discovered a path leading from the road to Tâl Methedras up the mountainside. There is an evil air about the path, so I will not go there, but I believe this may well be the path your friend Saeradan seeks.\
\
'Return to Saeradan and thank him for the kindness he has shown the People of the Boar and tell him of the path. Tell him also that none have travelled it recently.'","Huwela awaits you near the road to Tâl Methedras, north of the Rohirrim scout-camp.\
\
Léofward told you to meet with the Dunlending scout, Huwela, regarding the Old Woman of the Mountain.","'Huwela found the path, but none have travelled it recently? I wonder, then, what has become of Gwyllion since her defeat at the Slade of Shadows.\
\
'I think she must do one of two things: seek refuge with Saruman or find her way back to her own abode to recoup her strength.\
\
'I think if she appears at Orthanc in defeat, she will not find herself welcomed.'","Following the Battle of the Mustering Tree, a scout from the Dunlending Boar-clan resistance sent word to Léofward that she had news regarding the Old Woman of the Mountain."},
[3511]={"'I hear from the others that Athdurub the rider is no more, and that he fell at your hands.\
\
'And so the Malledhrim are avenged for their fallen! Well done.'","Commander Athdurub","Athdurub patrols the woods of Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Warg-rider Athdurub, commander of the Wargs of Gathbúrz.","'The Wargs of Gathbúrz are led by a particularly cunning goblin named Athdurub. His cunning and viciousness is matched by the size and power of the Warg he rides. Together they have already claimed the lives of several of the Malledhrim, striking without warning, then fleeing into the shadows of the forest as we advanced.\
\
'For now, he has withdrawn into Gathbúrz to help organize the Wargs against us, and I would have you strike against him while he can be more easily found and cornered -- even if it means dealing with several of his minions as you hunt.\
\
'He was seen patrolling the woods of Gathbúrz, so keep a wary eye out for him, lest he take you by surprise.'","The Wargs of Gathbúrz are led by Athdurub, a Warg-rider with a reputation for cunning and viciousness.","Talk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with tidings of Athdurub's defeat.","Defeat Commander Athdurub","Defeated Commander Athdurub","'The vile Wargs of Dol Guldur harass our flanks...defeat Athdurub, and they will know fear....'"},
[3512]={"The Orc-garrison at Bûrzkala is commanded by a fearsome creature known as Fikthrug.","Defeat Commander Fikthrug","'As long as Fikthrug remains, the forces of the Enemy here will be strong...he must be defeated!'","Defeated Commander Fikthrug","Fikthrug is at Bûrzkala, directly north of Thangúlhad.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to find and defeat the Orc-commander Fikthrug.","Commander Fikthrug","'We have learned that the Orcs of Gathbúrz are led on the ground by a commander named Fikthrug, somewhere in Búrzkala.\
\
'Alas, he himself is no more than a pawn of their masters in the tower, so it will not leave them leaderless, but if you can find and defeat this Orc it will be a significant blow to the Orcs' morale.\
\
'Bûrzkala lies to the north of here. When you have completed this deed, return to me.'","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz, south of Búrzkala.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your victory.","Talk to Rodelleth in Thangúlhad","'Fikthrug has fallen then? Good!\
\
'He may be easily replaceable, but every time a powerful Orc-leader falls, it sets off a merry row of infighting and assassination among the officers beneath him while they sort out who will take his place.\
\
'It is better that they spend their time fighting each other rather than us, I would say.'"},
[3513]={"Has derrotado al Comandante Târsh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El Comandante Târsh se encuentra en la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, al sureste del refugio élfico de Echad Mirobel. \
\
El Comandante Târsh, un uruk-hai lleno de orgullo, lidera las fuerzas de la Mano Blanca en un intento por obtener información antigua de la Escuela en la que ha establecido su campamento. Gelirwen desea que entres en la Escuela y te enfrentes a este bruto con la ayuda de una pequeña comunidad.'","Acaba con el Comandante Târsh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A juzgar por lo que sabemos de los movimientos de la Mano Blanca en esta zona, he deducido que hay un uruk-hai inteligente al frente de las fuerzas enemigas aquí, en Eregion.\
\
'En estos momentos está dirigiendo la operación de registro de las ruinas de la Escuela de Tham Mírdain, al sureste de Echad Mirobel. Según todos los indicios, es un guerrero temible, y su nombre es el Comandante Târsh. Quiero que entres en la Escuela de Tham Mírdain y te enfrentes a este astuto uruk-hai.\
\
'Se dice que tiene un gran ego y que se cree un guerrero sin igual. Quizá podamos usar esto en su contra. No lleves a más de dos personas contigo a la Escuela, pues no queremos atraer también la atención de nuestros enemigos del norte. Ya tenemos bastante con nuestras maniobras más agresivas contra esos enemigos, y sería realmente grave que unieran sus fuerzas.","Comandante Târsh"},
[3516]={"Preocupación por un amigo","'No soy de hablar de los amigos a sus espaldas, pero el viejo Falco ha estado actuando muy raro últimamente. ¿Podrías hablar con él? Su granja está al suroeste de aquí.'","'¿No te preocupa él? Pues he conocido al viejo Falco toda mi vida, y te digo que no hay nada que le importe más que su jardín. ¡No voy a quedarme aquí sin hacer nada!'","'Por favor, mis problemas son míos. Solo dile a Gammy Cenagales que no se preocupe por mí.'","La granja de Falco Manoverde está al suroeste de la granja de Gammy Cenagales.\
\
Gammy Cenagales, la chismosa local, te ha pedido que averigües por qué el jardín de Falco está fallando.","'Por favor, ¡déjame en paz! No necesito esto ahora. Tengo demasiadas cosas más de qué preocuparme que un entrometido. ¡Fuera! Mis problemas no son tuyos. Ve y dile a Gammy que deje de husmear.'","El jardín de Falco está fallando por una razón desconocida, causando angustia entre la gente de Entibo.","Habla con Falco Manoverde en su granja","Habla con Gammy Cenagales en su granja","'Me atrevería a decir que Falco Manoverde es el mejor jardinero de todo Entibo, y eso ya es decir mucho. Está muy orgulloso de ese jardín suyo, y no sin razón: ¡es todo un espectáculo! Últimamente no ha venido a visitar como solía hacerlo, y estoy un poco preocupada por él.\
\
'De hecho, escuché que su jardín está pasando por una mala racha y puede que no sobreviva la temporada. ¿Quizás puedas averiguar qué está pasando y tranquilizarme? La granja de Falco está al suroeste de aquí.\
\
'Falco es un buen amigo, y odiaría verlo perder ese jardín.'","Gammy Cenagales está en su granja, al noreste de la granja de Falco Manoverde.\
\
Falco Manoverde no quiso molestarte con sus problemas y te pidió que le dijeras a Gammy Cenagales que deje de husmear."},
[3517]={"Frithgeir is in Zudrugund.\
\
You have spoken with Nár, who seems to be fine, as normal as he ever is. You should return to Frithgeir.","Preocupación por un amigo","Concerned by the words of Saruman while you were imprisoned within Isengard, you wanted to check on the well-being of Nár and Frithgeir.","Nár is in the library at Zudrugund.\
\
You have spoken with Frithgeir and confirmed to yourself that Saruman was lying when he spoke of killing these dwarves.","Nár looks at you happily, but says nothing. It is a great relief to know that Saruman's words to you in Orthanc concerning this ancient dwarf were untrue.","'Well, this is a surprise! ${PLAYER}! I did not think to see you again. I thought you would be well on your way through Dunland by now!'\
\
Frithgeir listens with mounting surprise as you tell him that Saruman spoke as if he had killed Nár.\
\
'What lies this Wizard spins! He is like a great, fat spider, weaving webs of treachery and deceit! We have seen no sign of him or of his uruks since you departed. Something must have been keeping him busy. You can speak to Nár yourself, if you like. He is here in the library, as he generally is.'","'Hervin! What a long time it has been! I was just thinking about you. Did you ever find that bauble you wanted?'\
\
Nár laughs and strokes his beard.\
\
'Ah, too bad. I did miss you. I am glad you came back! That Ranger doesn't visit as much anymore. You know the one. His name was Túgonn. Never ate with us, which I thought was odd. Wasn't that his name? Túgonn? Or did it begin with a C?'\
\
Nár's brow creases with worry, but then just as suddenly the cloud passes.\
\
'Bring the beer over here, Hervin! We will drink to that Ranger, wherever he has gone, and wish him well!'","'You will find Nár here in the library. He is fine, but keep in mind that he is still Nár. His mind wanders.'","'Thank you for returning to Zudrugund to check on our safety, ${PLAYER}. It means a great deal to me to know that you were concerned for our well-being.\
\
'Perhaps you can ease my mind in something, as well. One of the Rangers stayed here for awhile, a young man named Corunir. Does he still fare well?'\
\
You tell Frithgeir that Corunir was fine the last time you saw him, but you have not seen him since you left the Gravenwood.\
\
'I see. I hope he is fine. I am sure he will be. I know he was frustrated by Nár, perhaps with reason, but he was generally kind to us in a difficult situation. When the uruks attacked, he would have died for us. I have not forgotten.\
\
'Thank you for coming to see us, ${PLAYER}! Take care of yourself, wherever you tread.'"},
[3518]={"Maelona is in Tûr Morva.\
\
Maelona will want to speak with you once you have regaled Gwynna and Olwen with tales of your homeland.","Maelona had never seen a hobbit before your arrival in Tûr Morva and wants you to share stories of your homeland with members of the Falcon-clan who are concerned by you.","'Penrod is here in Tûr Morva. He was asking for you.'","Gwynna looks at you warily, his face a mask of curiosity and fear.\
\
'You are a... halfling? Why are you... why are you so small?'\
\
He turns a bright shade of red, and you decide to defuse his embarrassment with tales of the Shire.","Talk to Gwynna in Tûr Morva","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, the halfling! Very good. I have heard you were telling some of our people stories of your homeland. It sounds like it was a good home.\
\
'My people had a good home once, but it was taken from us, long ago. Perhaps one day, we will have it again, but not as thralls to some Wizard. It is not worth that.'","Talk to Penrod in Tûr Morva","Talk to Olwen in Tûr Morva","Concerned by Hobbits","'What could have driven you to leave the Shire? It sounds like such a peaceful place, and I would have stayed there in comfort if even half of your stories about it are true!'","'Thank you for speaking with Gwynna and Olwen, ${PLAYER}. I know that your stories have helped show them that halflings are not a people to be feared.\
\
'Penrod, the first Brehur of Lheu Brenin, was looking to speak with you. He is here in Tûr Morva.'","'Gwynna and Olwen are here in Tûr Morva. Do not confuse Olwen with her sister! One of them is training to be a warrior, and one of them is a singer of songs. It is the singer who expressed her concerns to me.'","'You are the first halfling I have ever seen, ${PLAYER}. What strange times we live in!'\
\
Maelona laughs nervously.\
\
'I hope you do not think me rude to say so, but your appearance is most curious to my eyes and those of my fellows. We have seen dwarves, of course, but you are different even than that folk!\
\
'Perhaps if you were to share stories of your people and your homeland with the more distrustful members of my clan, they would be put at ease, good halfling. I am speaking of Gwynna and Olwen, who expressed their concerns to me when you arrived. You will find them here in Tûr Morva.'","Gwynna and Olwen can be found in Tûr Morva.\
\
Maelona told you that some of her fellows are distrustful of hobbits, having never seen one before, and you should tell them stories of your homeland.","Talk to Maelona in Tûr Morva","'Your homeland, this Shire, sounds most comfortable. Would that we were all so fortunate to live in such a place!'","Penrod, the first Brehur of Lheu Brenin, is in Tûr Morva. He has been asking for you.\
\
Maelona told you to speak with Penrod now that you have reassured her friends Gwynna and Olwen.","'I think you are looking for my sister Olwen. She is here in Tûr Morva.'","Olwen looks at you distrustfully.\
\
'How do we know that you are what you say you are? A hobbit? I have not heard of hobbits before. How do we know that you are not in league with Saruman?'\
\
You decide that Olwen might be more accepting if you tell her tales of the Shire."},
[3520]={"This den has been abandoned","'You have returned. Have you any news of the spiders' vanishing?'\
\
You relate all you found.\
\
'I see. Then they have truly left. Perhaps with Sauron's fall and the greening of these woods, they seek refuge in darker places?\
\
'If there be naught left but broodling stragglers, we should concern ourselves with more pressing matters.'","Search Imnagath","There is still prey caught in the webs of this abandoned den","Defeated spiders in Eryn Lasgalen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cleared spider webs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thranduil can be found in the halls of Felegoth.\
\
You should return to Thranduil.","The spiders have vanished from all over Mirkwood, and King Thranduil wishes to know why.","'Upon returning to these halls after the trials of battle, I learned of something surpassingly strange: the spiders of these woods are no more. Not by us were they slain, nor by any hand, from all we can tell. They have simply vanished, it seems, leaving only their web-covered dens.\
\
'Any person in my kingdom, be they Elf or not, who unravels this mystery shall earn my regard and generosity.'","Concerning Spiders","Only a few lost broodlings remain here","Known spider dens can be found throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should search the woods and remaining spider-dens for spiders.","Search Gwígar","Return to Thranduil","Clear spider webs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Search Glad Thaw","Defeat spiders in Eryn Lasgalen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3521]={"'¡Por la Barba de Durin, este será un día magnífico! Esta poción de Gandalf es exactamente lo que necesitamos para reducir a ruinas los campamentos de potes ígneos de los trasgos.\
\
'Fui a echar un vistazo rápido al campamento mientras estabas en Rivendel, y encontré lo que buscamos. ¿Ves esa cosa enorme en la ladera inferior, con el andamiaje y el gigantesco caldero ardiendo encima? Ese es el corazón de su producción, y ahí es donde golpearemos.\
\
'Tienen materiales para fabricar potes por todo el campamento; todo lo que debemos hacer es verter la poción de Gandalf en ese caldero y darle un empujón, y la mezcla hará el resto... ¡ya lo verás!'","Habla con Eywind cerca de la entrada al Paso Alto","'¡Ja! ¡Ahora expulsemos a los trasgos de las Montañas con fuego!'","Informa a Eywind sobre la destrucción provocada por la poción de Gandalf en el caldero ardiente.","'¿Nada aún con la pequeña poción de Gandalf, eh? El tiempo apremia, ¡vamos a la parte divertida!'","Has encontrado el caldero ardiente","Conflagración","El caldero ardiente está en una alta estructura de madera en Ghâshru, hacia el noreste.\
\
Eywind te dijo que viertas la poción de Gandalf en el caldero que los trasgos usan para producir sus potes ígneos y que lo vuelques para que la mezcla incendie los materiales por todo el campamento.","Lleva la poción de Gandalf al caldero ardiente","Vierte la poción de Gandalf en el caldero ardiente","'¡Ja, ja! ¡Bien hecho! Es un placer ver cómo los planes del enemigo estallan en su propia cara, ¿no es así, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'Ojalá pudiéramos hacer volar por los aires toda la Ciudad de los Trasgos también, pero me temo que su caída no será tan sencilla... ni tan limpia.'","Eywind y Nogmeldir han ideado un plan para usar la poción de Gandalf y sembrar el caos entre los trasgos."},
[3522]={"'You are not a soldier under my command, but I welcome any warriors. You have come at a time when I need good men the most. Will you join my ranks and defend Linhir?'","'You are a brave warrior and kind hearted for helping the Vale. Arvaethor suggests you head south to Dor-en-Ernil? I believe you will be of great aid to these people of eastern Belfalas. You should speak with Borhador as he is more familiar with which Gondorian captains reside in Dor-en-Ernil.'","Borhador can be found in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Speak with Borhador","Speak with Laerind","Laerind can be found in the village of Ethring.\
\
You should speak with Laerind.","Now that the enemy forces in Ringló Vale have lost their leader and had their ranks decimated, your focus has been directed to Dor-en-Ernil where corsairs have already come ashore.","Seek out Garvir in Linhir","'I thank you again for all that you have done for the people in Ringló Vale. There is great conflict to the south in Dor-en-Ernil. Corsairs have come ashore and push ever further inland.\
\
'Farewell my friend and may Gondor benefit from your aid.'","Conflict in Dor-en-Ernil","Garvir, the leader of the Dor-en-Ernil's Gondorian forces can be found in the city of Linhir.\
\
You should seek out Garvir in Linhir.","'You head to Dor-en-Ernil to take on the corsair forces? The sons of Comeldir have been stationed in Linhir I believe. Erchar, Herion, and Garvir are their names. I can not remember which one is leading the forces there. It might be Garvir? Oh, my mind has difficulty with names and faces at my age.\
\
'No matter, travel south-east to Linhir. It is a large city that spans across the river Gilrain which runs the border between Dor-en-Ernil and Lebennin. Safe travels.'"},
[3523]={"Nada de lo que has hecho por Adelard Tuk parece haber tenido efecto alguno en el \\qfantasma\\q de su biblioteca.","Ve a ver al fantasma del Viejo Tuk","Confronta al Viejo Tuk","Al acercarte a la estantería, esta empieza a temblar y a sacudirse. ¡Hay algo escondido detrás de la estantería!","'¿Así que no era el Gran Tuk el que rondaba mi biblioteca? ¡Muy bien, no debo dejar que estas costillas de jabalí especiadas se echen a perder!'","'Por favor, ve a ver al fantasma del Viejo Tuk en mi biblioteca. ¡Quizá puedas apaciguarlo!'","Has conseguido ahuyentar a la ardilla de la biblioteca de Adelard.","La presencia del fantasma es más fuerte en el rincón más alejado de la biblioteca de Adelard, cerca de la pequeña estantería.\
\
Después de que todo lo demás fracasara, Adelard Tuk te ha pedido que entres en su biblioteca y vayas a ver al fantasma del Viejo Tuk.","Adelard Tuk está fuera de la biblioteca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Al ir a ver al \\qfantasma\\q en la biblioteca de Adelard Tuk, has descubierto que no era más que una ardilla escondida detrás de los muebles. Debes decirle a Adelard que ya puede volver a su biblioteca.","'¿Una ardilla? ¿No era más que una... una simple y gris ardilla? Oh, cielos, esto es embarazoso. ¿Qué pensarán los demás si se enteran de esto?\
\
'¡Oh, ya sé lo que dirán! Dirán que estoy tan loco como el viejo Bilbo. ¡Cielos, cielos! ¿Sería mucho pedirte que no informes de este incidente?\
\
'¡Estaré encantado de dejar este asunto atrás! Y pensar en todos los problemas que te he causado. ¡Lamento mucho haberte molestado tanto!'","'¡Estoy completamente al borde de la desesperación! Nada de lo que hemos hecho ha apaciguado al fantasma del Viejo Tuk. No se me ocurre nada más que hacer. Nunca volveré a tener mi biblioteca. Qué hacer, qué hacer...\
\
'Espera... no, es demasiado terrible para pedirlo. Pero debo recuperar mi biblioteca. Ya has hecho mucho por mí, pero ¿podría pedirte que reúnas tu valor y te enfrentes tú mismo al fantasma del Viejo Tuk?\
\
'Con mucha precaución, entra en mi biblioteca y quizás -- ya que has hecho tanto para tratar de apaciguarlo -- el Viejo Tuk te conceda una audiencia. Su presencia parece ser más fuerte en el rincón más alejado de la habitación, junto a mi pequeña estantería. ¡Por favor, ten cuidado!'","'Todavía no puedo creer que tuviera miedo de una ardilla, por gris que fuera.'"},
[3524]={"Enemigos derrotados en Cotfast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entra en Cotfast","Recoger oro para sobornos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Llama a la puerta donde se esconde Gothtal","Oro para sobornos conseguido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Analiza la situación en la puerta occidental de Puente de Caballetes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aran Verduno se encuentra cerca de Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno cerca de Cotfast.","Habla con Aran Verduno","Las obras de reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes continúan.\
\
Deberías echar un vistazo a la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes","'Desde que te uniste a la Hermandad de los Leñadores, hemos logrado mucho. Puente de Caballetes ha sido restaurada en gran medida, el Bosque Salvaje es más seguro y el ánimo de los habitantes del pueblo ha mejorado. La Hermandad te está muy agradecida como miembro tanto de nuestras filas como de nuestra comunidad. Yo te doy las gracias, todos te damos las gracias, por tus esfuerzos aquí. Has convertido a Puente de Caballetes en el faro que estaba destinada a ser.'","'Hay varios enemigos que residen en Cotfast. Debemos acabar con ellos rápidamente y destruir todo lo que encontremos que relacione a Gothtal con este pueblo. Sin duda, el orco está sobornando a los habitantes del Bosque Salvaje con oro y otras riquezas.\
\
'Una vez que el pueblo esté despejado, derrotaremos a Gothtal. ¡Por Puente de Caballetes!'","'${PLAYER}, parece que hay algún problema en la puerta de Puente de Caballetes que conduce al Bosque Salvaje. Los guardias no saben qué decir. Ven, acerquémonos a la puerta de Puente de Caballetes y averigüemos qué está pasando.'","Habla con Aran Verduno cerca de Cotfast","El edificio en el que se esconde Gothtal se encuentra en Cotfast.\
\
Deberías llamar a la puerta y enfrentarte a Gothtal.","En Cotfast encontrarás botines orcos y oro para sobornos.\
\
Debes destruir los botines orcos, recoger el oro para sobornos y derrotar a los enemigos en Cotfast.","Acaba con enemigos en Cotfast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La alarma del pueblo de Cotfast se encuentra cerca.\
\
Deberías hacer sonar la alarma para llamar la atención de Gothtal.","'Me sorprende que Gothtal fuera derrotado tan fácilmente. Ahora sabemos que solo era un intermediario de ese tal Zarquino, que parece tener intereses en gran parte de Bree y las regiones circundantes. Zarquino no puede ser simplemente un orco, con todas las fechorías que conlleva ese nombre. En cualquier caso, estos no son problemas en los que deba detenerse la Hermandad de los Leñadores. Debemos seguir centrándonos en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
'Se ha restaurado otro edificio en la ciudad, ${PLAYER}. ¿Te gustaría inspeccionar la calidad del trabajo?'","Haz sonar la alarma del pueblo de Cotfast","¡Una gran parte de Puente de Caballetes ha sido reconstruida! (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Has derrotado a Gothtal","'Este Gothtal ha ido demasiado lejos. Se burla de nosotros mientras nosotros no hacemos nada y él trama ataques. ¡Ya basta! He encargado a los leñadores al servicio de la ciudad que informen de cualquier avistamiento de Gothtal directamente a la Hermandad de los Leñadores. Acabo de recibir un informe muy reciente de que el orco ha regresado a Cotfast. Propongo que marchemos hacia Cotfast y nos enfrentemos a Gothtal. ¡Sus días de provocar a Puente de Caballetes han terminado!'","Como era de esperar, nadie abrió la puerta","Cotfast se encuentra en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías entrar en Cotfast.","Enfrentamiento en Cotfast","Has examinado la situación (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Han dejado algo en la puerta oeste de Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías ir a ver qué pasa allí.","Supervisa la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Destruye botines orcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Botines orcos destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ya está hecho. La amenaza de Gothtal para el Bosque Salvaje y Puente de Caballetes ha desaparecido. Vamos, regresemos a la ciudad.'","Habla con Aran Verduno en Puente de Caballetes","Suena la alarma y aparece Gothtal","La Hermandad de los Leñadores ha decidido acabar con la amenaza de los orcos en el Bosque Salvaje de una vez por todas.","Aran Verduno se encuentra en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno.","Derrota a Gothtal"},
[3525]={"Dervorin is going to confront Dravron over his taxes, or lack thereof.\
\
Talk to him when you're ready to accompany him.","You have returned to Ethring with Dervorin.\
\
Talk to Dervorin.","Talk to Dervorin","It is time to confront Dravron.","'Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]}, deberíamos partir ahora.'","'Dravron is in custody, as are the brigands in his employ. Hopefully this spells the end of this sordid affair.'","'If we can prove that Dravron has been attempting to cheat on his taxes, we can turn the situation to our advantage.'","Confronting Dravron"},
[3526]={"Defeated Shakfut's supporters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Drive Shakfut from the area","Shakfut is in command of Ugrukhôr's troops in Zhar Skator, west of Barad Angarth. If he is driven off, the remaining forces might push towards Gothmog's troops.","Confronting Shakfut","Shakfut has fled from the area!","Shakfut is currently leading Ugrukhôr's troops in this area. He has been able to prevent his forces from pushing towards Gothmog's encampment on the western side of the Circle of Wrath.\
\
You should drive off Shakfut and defeat his most loyal warriors.","'Thank you, ${CLASS}. With Shakfut driven away, these Orcs may push on Gothmog's forces and give us just the opportunity we need!'","Defeat Shakfut's supporters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Greetings, ${CLASS}. Our time is short but we have an opportunity to destabilize Ugrukhôr's forces.\
\
'Ugrukhôr's captain is an Orc named Shakfut, and he, it seems, is the only creature with leadership enough to keep his warriors in check. If something were to happen to him, well, who can say what the others might do?'\
\
'You should drive off Shakfut and defeat his closest supporters.'","Talk to Dolenthol","You have driven away Shakfut and his most loyal supporters.\
\
You should return to Dolenthol and inform him of your victory."},
[3529]={"Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 1)","Defeat the Beasts of Slaughter","The final battle of the War of Three Peaks has begun. Prince Durin Stonehelmson of the Longbeards will lead the great force of united dwarves in an assault on the main gates of Gundabad. But the Orkish chieftain, Gorgar the Ruthless, has one final surprise in store for his enemies.","You have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 1.","Gorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish.\
\
You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.","Completed: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 1)","Defeat Gorgar and Ránulur","'The time has come to bring this war to its end. Muster your allies and prepare for a fierce battle. Join me, ${PLAYER}, as we bring the fight to Gorgar the Ruthless, and claim Gundabad!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest tracks your progress for the Tier 1 difficulty of Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold. It allows you and your fellows to resume adventuring in Amdân Dammul at the furthest checkpoint you have reached in each weekly cycle. This quest will automatically reset every Monday, Thursday, and Saturday.</rgb>","You have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself!\
\
You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!"},
