Debes completar la tarea de Forgamthan para poder progresar como erudito.","'Well done, ${PLAYER}. Your work was greatly admired by the Elves who received your fine scrolls. They were moved by the scholarly craftsmanship and by the unique skill that went into making each one. I am impressed!\
