'But perhaps it is not to be so? Can it be we will see your true mettle here instead? I call forth your next challenge, and may you prove its equal!'","You are victorious, and Ezaphir returns to the fighting sands","Ezaphir will issue your first challenge when you are ready to compete.","You have defeated Rothog the Storm, and the spoils of victory are yours!","Ezaphir congratulates you on your victory, but there are more difficult challenges to come.","The gladiatorial pits of Umbar Baharbêl serve several important purposes: entertaining the masses, keeping their attention focused, and meting justice upon those who break the laws of the city.\
\
Upon taking control of Umbar, the Kindred of the Coins altered the traditional rules of the arena. Most battles are no longer to the death, and the memory of such capital punishment has remained in the cruel past. Combat has become a sport for the masses, and any who dare can enter the fighting pits and attempt to enhance their glory. Gladiators bound to the arena serve their sentences by entering battle and fighting to the end.","Ezaphir congratulates you on your success, but he warns you the following challenges may not be so easy.","Ezaphir calls forth your final challenge: Rothog the Storm!","'We are honoured by your presence here today! I shall call forth the first set of the Khâbraghai, the blade-fodder, so you may warm up your muscles and get your blood flowing!\
\
'The crowd wants to cheer for you, but on some days they can be fickle-minded. They want to see a good show. See that they do.'","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the second challenge","Talk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena","'I welcome you to my domain: Dahâl Huliz, the grand arena of Umbar Baharbêl! I consider these sands to be sacred ground; you should do the same. In this place, those who are accused fight for their freedom, and those who are not fight for greater glory.\
\
'On this day we fight not to the death, for those who perish would be unable to entertain the crowds on the morrow. Instead we fight until a combatant's first submission. In that way those who lose can be spared, that they may gain in strength, and fight again on a future day.\
\
'Be warned, for the Arena plays host to many surprises. May you fight well! Give all those who attend a magnificent show and you will have their approval, as I do!'","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the fourth challenge","Rothog awaits you in the Arena.","Ezaphir calls forth the second challenge!","'Your greatest challenge has arrived, my impressive friend. Will you face it with courage and with strength, or will its arrival send you screaming from these sands in fear?\
\
'I believe in you, though all the crowd cheers for your opponent. They do not think you have what it will take to best this final opponent, and why should they? You must win them over. You must attain their belief with a great display of your prowess and your fighting skill!\
\
'Your final challenge is this: you must defeat he who calls this place home. Rothog the Storm is your final opponent, my friend, and he is a mighty foe indeed. Can you take this crown from him? Can you defeat the Arena's favourite son and champion? We will see, friend. Show us now, and win glory for your name!\
\
'Fight now! Dahâl Huliz will ring with the sound of battle, and let the cheering of the crowd ascend even to the stars above!'","Defeated the First Challenge!","Defeated the Third Challenge!","Ezaphir will call forth one of the more stalwart gladiators to test your mettle in glorious combat.","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat the third challenge","'Well-struck, and well done. Every victory adds to the story of your name.\
\
'But do not rest yet, for now I call forth the next round of Khâbraghai. Will you best these as you did the others? Do not let down your guard! The crowd will prepare themselves for the more challenging contest to come, but you must focus upon each battle as it is joined, and not look past them to the next!'","Talk to Ezaphir and defeat Rothog the Storm","Ezaphir calls forth the fourth challenge!","'Any who have sat in the stands of Dahâl Huliz know the names of the favoured champions who do battle on the fighting sands. You will face one of these now! Use your wit, guile, and strength to survive, and perhaps your own name will be raised as high!\
\
'Now will I call them forth!'","Defeated the Second Challenge!"},
[3849]={"'¿Acaso no tienes juicio, necio Sivullinen? ¿Te atreves a entrar en nuestro campamento sin anunciarte? Aunque, claro, te acercas haciendo tanto ruido como una manada de norsu, así que no es difícil seguirte.\
\
'Estamos hartos de ti, Sivullinen. Traes contigo los males del mundo, arrastrando la desdicha a nuestras tierras. Tendrás que dejar claras tus verdaderas intenciones si esperas que aceptemos tu paso por la tundra.\
\
'Si deseas adentrarte más en la estepa del norte, habla con el centinela que guarda nuestra frontera con el bosque. Su puesto se encuentra en el camino del noroeste. Te observará atentamente en busca de cualquier indicio de… intenciones cuestionables.'","Guardias lossoth vigilan desde una tienda de centinela situada al noroeste de Kauppa-kohta, en el límite del bosque. Los guardias han avistado lobos con frecuencia, algo que se ha vuelto cada vez más habitual.","'¡No! No, me están tendiendo una trampa. Me rodean y… y… lo siento, es solo que el terror que provocaron aún me recorre todo el cuerpo.\
\
'Fueron los susi, lo que vosotros llamáis lobos. Al principio pensé que el viento se había convertido en una tormenta terrible, pero entonces comenzaron a aullar… lamentos demenciales, como un grupo de niños exaltados jugando a algún juego. Sus horribles chillidos de placer se transformaron en gruñidos mientras destrozaban mi tienda.\
\
'Estaba seguro de que me harían pedazos, pero en cuanto se llevaron mis escasas provisiones de comida, toda la manada desapareció.'","Habla con el guardia del puesto de centinela","'Si de verdad deseas ayudarnos, habla con los guardias que vigilan el camino hacia el noroeste.'","Defensa diaria","El puesto de centinela se encuentra al noroeste de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Santtu te ha indicado que hables con los guardias del puesto si deseas ganarte su confianza."},
