'The Conquest of Gorgoroth has decreed that Dor Amarth and Agarnaith are the targets for today. Check the bounty board for specific tasks in those areas. Good luck.'","Daily Expedition: Dor Amarth and Agarnaith","'The Conquest of Gorgoroth thanks you for you aid, adventurer. Take this as a token of our gratitude. See me again tomorrow for a new task.'","TBD","Complete 4 Allegiance quests in Dor Amarth or Agarnaith","'Hail, friend of the Elves.\
\
'We have identified that currently Dor Amarth and Agarnaith hold the greatest threats to our people. Your efforts are best spend there today. See the bounty board for specific information. Travel with care, and represent us well.'","'Hello, friend! Prepared for an adventure?\
\
'Today, we would like you to focus your efforts in Dor Amarth and Agarnaith. The bounty board has many things to do, and we would be grateful for whatever aid you can offer. Be careful out there!'","Expedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls.\
