[3899]={"Examine the mine at Gebarakór","Examine the mine at Lâkindar","Nothing has visibly changed at the mine","Lâkindar remains haunted by shades and wights","Though the mines have been inspected, the dwarves of Jiret-menêsh still wish to ensure that no ill-activity has returned to the places where they may yet go. Return to the four mines and inspect them.","The open pit-mine is still in use by the Ordâkhai","Examine the mine at Erakúndo","Daily: Keeping Up Inspections","Adazâr remains sealed and populated by kergrim","Examine the mine at the Arch of Adazâr","'Are the mines still in their current state? Since you are unafraid to traverse this land, would you be willing to return to these locations and tell me how they fare? I am most curious about Erakúndo, Gebarakór, Adazâr, and Lâkindar.\
\
'If all is unchanged, there is no reason to return, friend.'"},
