\
Defeat the Dead near Jag Golód.","Defeated sorcerous Dead near Jag Golód in Kighân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fell magic has long plagued the lands of Kighân. With the restoration at hand, the people desire to rid the fell things that disturb their dead. Help them pay respects and purge the Restless Dead.\
