[3906]={"Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land.\
\
Collect ingredients for nakhód júra to deliver to Aphadar at his farm, or craft nakhód júra for delivery to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna.","Collect bowls of nakhód júra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver nakhód júra to Lejâl, at Zajâna","Collected bowls of nakhód júra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Deliver crafted nakhód júra to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna.","'Ah, nakhód júra, the stew of oryx and chickpeas, a humble yet noble fare. Long has it brought warmth to the hearts of the folk of Kighân, and warmed bellies in times of wind and want. Your gift shall be provided to those who hunger. This kindness will not be forgotten.'","Daily: More Nakhód Júra","Kighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land.\
\
Craft nakhód júra for delivery to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna."},
