Tras haber completado los pasos de baile necesarios, habla con la maestra de baile para aprender el baile de los Hombres.","Paso realizado","'¡Estuviste increíble! Mereces conocer el baile de los Hombres. Bailas con mucha gracia. ¡Gracias por acompañarnos!'"},
[3928]={"Herthdúr tuvo un desafortunado encuentro con los rondadores de arenas que merodean entre las dunas de Barandalf y desea poner fin a la amenaza que suponen para los viajeros.","Herthdúr está en el campamento de los montaraces junto al Coloso, al noroeste de Barandalf.\
\
Has acabado con algunos de los rondadores de arenas que merodean entre las dunas de Barandalf y deberías informar de tu éxito a Herthdúr.","'Los rondadores de arenas son una preocupación menor ahora, ${PLAYER}.'","'¿Has derrotado a los rondadores de arenas de Barandalf? ¡Me alegra oírlo y te recompensaré por tus esfuerzos en consecuencia!'","'Los rondadores de arenas se pueden encontrar por todo Barandalf, al sureste de aquí, pero especialmente cerca de Lithost. Lithost está en el lado opuesto del Brandivino respecto a Barad Tharsír.'","'¡Mi inventario de mercancías es insuperable!'","Se pueden encontrar rondadores de arenas por todo Barandalf, pero especialmente en Lithost, al sureste del Coloso, al otro lado del río respecto a las ruinas de Barad Tharsír.\
\
Herthdúr te ha pedido que derrotes a algunos de los rondadores de arenas que hacen que viajar por Barandalf sea peligroso para él y su inventario de mercancías.","Rondadores de arenas derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Peligro entre las dunas","Habla con Herthdúr en el campamento del Coloso","'Me enorgullezco de la gran variedad de suministros que llevo, ${PLAYER}, y hago todo lo posible por mantener mi inventario. ¡Imagina la decepción si viajara a las tierras del sur y no tuviera las diversas baratijas que tanto gustan a los hobbits de allí! No, debo mantener mis existencias en todo momento.\
\
'¡Pero no es fácil! Para llegar a Dwaling y a Avenal, tienes que viajar al sureste de Tinnudir y pasar por Barandalf; las arenas y dunas de ese lugar ahora son el hogar de criaturas viles y peligrosas. En mi último viaje, me sorprendieron bastante los tentáculos apresadores de varios rondadores de arenas... ¡apenas logré escapar con vida y con mi inventario!\
\
'Eso es inaceptable, ${PLAYER}. Si logras derrotar a algunos de los rondadores de arenas, te lo agradecería enormemente y te recompensaría como es debido. Encontrarás a muchas de las criaturas cerca de Lithost, a orillas del Brandivino. Lithost está al otro lado del río y ligeramente al sur de Barad Tharsír, por si estás familiarizado con esas ruinas.'","Derrota a los rondadores de arenas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3929]={"Los enemigos se encuentran en los niveles más altos de Khadar-zarâm en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos que esperan en la escalera para emboscar a los viajeros inocentes.","'¡Bien hecho! Ahora no tendré que temer que mis dedos de los pies sean empalados por lanzas arrojadas cuando comience mi ascenso!'","Svanr se encuentra al pie de la gran escalera en el oeste de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes regresar con Svanr y decirle que has eliminado a muchos enemigos en Khadar-zarâm.","'¿Has encontrado algún peligro en las escaleras? Lo pregunto porque casi me mata una lanza que me lanzaron desde arriba. Sospecho que los trasgos son los culpables, pero fueron demasiado cobardes para mostrarse.\
\
'Si vuelves a subir, no tengo dudas de que encontrarás trasgos maquinando y traviesos esperando con sus palos puntiagudos listos. Yo, por mi parte, no los extrañaré si deseas partir algunos de sus cráneos.'","Peligro en Khadar-zarâm","Elimina enemigos en la cima de Khadar-zarâm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vuelve con Svanr","Svanr casi fue asesinado por una lanza que le lanzaron mientras bajaba por Khadar-zarâm, la gran escalera de Nud-melek. ¡Eso solo puede significar una cosa: trasgos arriba!"},
[3930]={"'Thane Edric wishes to know what has become of our foes?\
\
'The Uruks still ride along the plains, and the King has done naught to drive them off.  He stripped us of most of our men, and soon we shall be even fewer when Léoflad and the rest depart. The Uruks circle us like vultures, ${PLAYER}, and there is no telling when they shall strike at us next or if they direct their wrath towards Middlemead.\
\
'That is all of I know of what is to come, ${PLAYER}. The people must make ready to leave as soon as they are able.'","Danger in Silence","'It is as I feared, ${PLAYER}. More foes rally around our lands even now, and with such little time before my people depart.\
\
'We shall have to find and strike at these threats as soon as we are able, for only then will my people find safe passage.'","'Entwade has been the victim of many assaults as of late, ${PLAYER}. For my part, my men and I have kept the people from harm and our homes largely intact. \
\
'However, in the past week, the attacks have ceased. It does not take one well-versed in strategy to presume that a larger attack will soon fall upon us. I have been busy helping my wife prepare the people for travel to Aldburg and any new information of our foes' whereabouts has not yet been delivered to me.\
\
'If you would, speak to my guards near the Entwash and in town. They may have more insight on the dangers we'll be left to deal with once my people depart.'","Talk to Inguc","Talk to Anrad","Talk to Thane Edric","'It has been long since I have spoken with Thane Edric, and while it is  true that the relative peace has held, I fear it will soon end.\
\
'During my post a few days ago, I spied Orcs crossing the Entwash -- with much difficulty, mind you -- passing onto the shore of Kingstead. These Orcs looked different, and they did not bear the markings of the White Hand. Moreover, they appeared to be fleeing from the farmstead nearby. Perhaps Reeve Fastred is as brutal as I have heard it told....\
\
'I am not one to believe that an Orc can know fear, so I am certain we have not seen the last of them. Thane Edric surely knows not of this, and he must be advised about such troubles.'","Talk to Ordgar","Ordgar can be found near the gates into Entwade.\
\
Thane Edric has asked that you speak to his guards inside and near the river Entwash to learn of any news of the Enemy's whereabouts in Kingstead.","Thane Edric can be found near the waggons outside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to Edric's men and learned much of the threats facing Kingstead. You should now return to Thane Edric.","Thane Edric and Léoflad struggle to ensure the safety of their people as the forces of the Enemy draw ever closer.","Anrad can be found slightly to the north outside the gates of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to Inguc of more threats in Kingstead. You should speak to Anrad before returning to Thane Edric.","'I cannot tell you much more than you already know, ${PLAYER}. \
\
'The Uruk-hai have roamed in from both east and west, and I fear that they have stolen the horses of the Broadacres in their travels. I fear that they are responsible for Middlemead's silence as of late as well, though I know Mágla would not allow such foes to come close to his people. Ah well, the troubles facing Entwade are numerous enough.\
\
'None shall be safe until the roads are cleared of their kind, and of that, I am sure Thane Edric knows.'","DNT -- Players will not see","Inguc can be found slightly to the south-east outside the gates of Entwade.\
\
You have spoken to Ordgar. You should continue to speak to Thane Edric's guards in hopes of discovering why the attacks have ceased in the past week."},
[3931]={"The footprints head west","'Well done, ${PLAYER}! I have never heard of such a creature as you describe, but I do not doubt the danger it represented.'","'I know not what this portends, but I fear a terrible beast lurks in the hills....'","Danger in the Hills","'I am concerned, ${PLAYER}, by the evidence you discovered while patrolling the Gloomglens. The crushed boulder and skeleton would be enough to cause concern, but I find the footprint particularly worrisome. The might and stature of the creature suggests a giant or some kind of troll, but the footprint you describe seems more bestial.\
\
'There are many creatures in this world of which we have little or no knowledge, and such a creature would pose a genuine threat to the Grey Company. Therefore, I ask that you track the monster to its lair and dispose of it.\
\
'Be wary upon your hunt, ${PLAYER}. I fear this beast is more cunning and subtle than its stature suggests.'","The fifth footprint lies to the south-west of the fourth.\
\
You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.","The footprints head to the south-west","The footprints lead into a cave to the north-west","The fourth footprint lies to the west of the third, south and west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.","Find the third footprint","Return to the site of the first footprint","Find the fourth footprint","Find the second footprint","Enter the Grey King's lair and defeat the creature","The footprints continue west","Himeinior is at Echad Idhrenfair, north-east of the Grey King's lair.\
\
You have defeated the creature known as the Grey King and should return to Himeinior with news of your victory.","The footprints continue off to the south","The creature's lair lies to the north-west of the fifth footprint, south-west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
Himeinior bade you defeat the unknown creature.","The Ranger Himeinior was disturbed by the crushed boulder and skeleton you discovered while patrolling the Gloomglens.","The third footprint lies to the west of the second, south and west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.","The footprint you found lies to the west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
Himeinior has asked you to return to the site of the footprint you found and track the beast to its lair.","The second footprint lies to the south of the first, which was to the west of Echad Idhrenfair.\
\
You should continue to track the beast to its lair.","Find the fifth footprint","Talk to Himeinior at Echad Idhrenfair"},
[3932]={"Explore to the north-west of Artamir's camp","Artamir has asked you to investigate a number of different locations in the Dead Marshes, seeking some clue to the Orkish presence here. He asked you to seek out notable spots to the north, north-west, and west, and said he would do the same.","The sound of insects is overwhelming at this nest, and you do not want to tarry","'Ah, hello... hello, my friend. You... you have come back?'\
\
Artamir blinks at you groggily. He seems to be having some difficulty focusing on your face, and often shakes his head, as if trying to clear it of a foggy sensation.\
\
'I am fine, ${PLAYER}. I just... you know, I saw the oddest thing: a treasure, just below the water. I could nearly reach it, but then it seemed to be gone. I remembered that you were expecting to see me again, and I came back to meet you.\
\
'This place does play tricks upon the mind, does it not?'","Talk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes","'I am troubled by the presence of the Orcs, ${PLAYER}, and I can tell by your expression that you are as well. Have they come here for the same reason that I have? I daresay they have some fell purpose, quite unlike that of the Ruling Steward, but still I must ask: how many reasons can there be to come to such a miserable land?\
\
'Perhaps you can find some hint to their objectives by exploring this foul swamp, my friend. There are notable places to be found, of a certainty, but you must step carefully! Try searching to the north, north-west, and west of my camp, and you may find some clues to the Orc interest here. While you are at it, you might also find the entrance to the Orc camp, for I think it likely they have established one. Do not go inside just yet! But we should know where it might be found, wouldn't you say?\
\
'I will search as well, and meet you back at this place. Walk with caution! I have found the footing to be treacherous.'","Below the water's surface, the drowned wood seems to beckon with watery tendrils","'Perhaps you can find some hint to their objectives by exploring this foul swamp, my friend. There are notable places to be found, of a certainty, but you must step carefully! Try searching to the north, north-west, and west of my camp, and you may find some clues to the Orc interest here. While you are at it, you might also find the entrance to the Orc camp, for I think it likely they have established one. Do not go inside just yet! But we should know where it might be found, wouldn't you say?\
\
'I will search as well, and meet you back at this place. Walk with caution! I have found the footing to be treacherous.'","This rocky crag rises out of the swamp, and you feel exposed against the sky","Explore to the north of Artamir's camp","You have learned that the Orcs were sent into the Dead Marshes for some purpose. Did Frodo come this way, and does the Dark Master of the Orcs know of his passage?","You have found some interesting spots within the Dead Marshes, but few clues to the Orkish presence here. You should return now to Artamir's camp. Perhaps he found something of note.","Find the entrance to the Orc camp","You have found the entrance to the Orc camp, as Artamir requested","Explore to the west of Artamir's camp","Danger in the Marshes"},
[3933]={"El condestable Tanglerush está preocupado por el aumento del número de animales salvajes que se ven cerca de las fronteras de Entibo.","'Hay muchos cerdoespín rampantes al sureste, cerca de la casa del condestable Bolger. Sal del pueblo por el camino este, y cuando llegues a la granja de la Viuda Froghorn, dirígete directamente al sur hasta llegar a la casa del condestable Bolger.'","'¡Los jabalíes son criaturas peligrosas, pero tú demostraste ser su ${PLAYERNAME:amo[m]|ama[f]}, !'","El condestable Tanglerush está en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
El condestable Tanglerush estará complacido de saber que has reducido la población de jabalíes cerca de Entibo.","'Gracias por la ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Me alivia mucho que hayas reducido la población de jabalíes antes de que hirieran a alguien de Entibo. Ya pensaba que era solo cuestión de tiempo, pero has demostrado mi error, ¡y lo celebro!'","'Los buenos habitantes de Entibo proporcionan a gran parte de las Tierras de Bree alimentos frescos cultivados en sus granjas, y les damos las gracias por ello. Nuestro capitán en Bree ha asignado a mis compañeros y a mí la tarea de vigilar este pueblo.\
\
'Recientemente, ha habido un aumento de animales salvajes fuera de Entibo. Si no hacemos algo, alguno de la Gente Pequeña está destinado a ser atacado en su camino a casa desde los campos, y el pueblo estará en un alboroto.\
\
'El condestable Bolger informó de un gran número de jabalíes cerca de su casa al sureste de aquí. Su casa está al sur de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn. Si pudieras encargarte de esos jabalíes, ayudaría.'","Cerdoespín rampantes derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Cualquier amenaza para los buenos habitantes de Entibo debe ser tratada de manera rápida y decisiva.'","Jabalíes Peligrosos","Los jabalíes se pueden encontrar cerca de la casa del condestable Bolger, al sureste de Entibo, al sur de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
El condestable Tanglerush quiere que reduzcas la población de jabalíes cerca de Entibo antes de que uno de los hobbits sea atacado."},
[3934]={"'Thank you, ${CLASS}. I will ensure that these vermin are routed from our realm.'","Guaridas de Taurogrim destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Thorlind","Taurog-dens can be found in Tholkát, in northern Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should destroy Taurog-dens in Tholkát.","Thorlind can be found near Tholkát.\
\
You should talk to Thorlind.","The Taurogrim have taken over an area of Eryn Lasgalen called Tholkát. Thorlind has asked you to cleanse this area of their evil, including their accursed dens.","Dangerous Dens","'It seems the Taurogrim have built their dwellings here in Tholkát. They must be destroyed if this place will ever heal to its former splendor.'","Destruye guaridas de Taurogrim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3935]={"Defeat kergrim in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kyrstig has asked you to stop the kergrim from consuming the dwarf-corpses in the Akhaldarâg tombs.","Kyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.","Defeated kergrim in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have slain many kergrim? Good work, ${PLAYER}! I think kergrim may be my least-favourite of the creatures that dwell beneath the mountains. Aye, even worse than Orcs! That's how much I dislike the vile creatures!'","Kergrim can be found throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.","Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg","'The kergrim and Angmarim seek to control the tombs in Akhaldarâg, but neither of them must be allowed to win the contest! Each group is vile in its own way, but the kergrim turn my stomach. Defeat as many as you can, and keep them from feasting upon the fallen!'","Dangerous Dwarf-eaters"},
[3936]={"Un carro yace destrozado en el camino, y hay señales de que fue atacado","Empresa Peligrosa","Tim Rastrojal condujo su carro al sur de Echad Candelleth, siguiendo la carretera hacia Acebeda, que cruza un pequeño vado al este de la cabaña de Garbert y asciende hacia la Cordillera de Acebeda.\
\
Tongannel te ha pedido que sigas el camino hacia el sur y busques cualquier señal de Tim Rastrojal para calmar sus temores por su seguridad.","La caja está rota y vacía, pero el cartel dice 'Propiedad de T. Rastrojal'","Busca cualquier rastro de Tim Rastrojal en el camino a Acebeda","'Mi corazón ha estado intranquilo durante los últimos días, ${PLAYER}, y espero que puedas tranquilizar mis temores. Un viajero de Bree llamado Tim Rastrojal pasó por Echad Candelleth camino al sur; era un artesano y llevaba figurillas de madera de calidad exquisita que esperaba vender en mercados lejanos. Quería reunir suficiente dinero para mantener a su joven esposa, Nora, y estaba muy entusiasmado con sus planes.\
\
'Pero la carretera rara vez es transitada, y desde que dejó el campamento, una preocupación ha ido creciendo en mi mente. Si no es mucho pedir, ¿podrías tomar el camino hacia el sur en dirección a Acebeda y comprobar que no ha tenido problemas? Estoy segura de que todo está bien, pero me sentiría más tranquila si lo confirmaras.\
\
'El camino a Acebeda va hacia el sur de Echad Candelleth y cruza el Bruinen en un pequeño vado al este de la cabaña de Garbert, donde asciende de forma constante hasta llegar a la Cordillera de Acebeda.'","Tongannel ha tenido un mal presentimiento durante los últimos días y teme que no augure nada bueno para el viajero de Bree con quien entabló amistad."},
[3937]={"Dangerous Game: Aurochs","Defeat Thrumtróth the Thunderer","Talk to Rékar","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Thrumtróth the Thunderer and other aurochs can be found in the wilderness of the Dale-lands.\
\
You should hunt aurochs and Thrumtróth the Thunderer.","Defeated aurochs in the Dale-lands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'My last challenge for you is the legendary aurochs named Thrumtróth the Thunderer. The people of Dale have told stories about him for generations. The sound of his charging hooves is said to bring on storms, his horns are sharper than spears, his hide as thick as plate mail. I doubt any of that is true, but I did lay eyes on a massive aurochs myself, with the biggest horns I have ever seen. Bringing down such a beast would make the hunter a legend unto himself. Are you up for it, ${PLAYER}?'","Defeat aurochs in the Dale-lands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Thrumtróth the Thunderer","'My my, ${PLAYER}, you actually tracked down and bested that legendary beast. You truly are the master hunter. The bards will tell stories of your accomplishments for years to come!'"},
[3938]={"'I see you were successful! Here is your pay. Ready to hunt a deadlier beast?'","Talk to Rékar","Northern river-avanc and Fenskin can be found in the Marshes in the Dale-lands.\
\
You should hunt northern river-avanc and Fenskin.","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Defeated Fenskin","Dangerous Game: Avanc","Defeat northern river-avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hail, adventurer. You look like you can handle yourself out there. How about a challenge? I am a huntsman and fur-trader, and there is plenty to hunt in the Dale-lands. But, there are some well-known beasts that lurk in the wilds that even I have been unable to defeat. If you were to do some hunting for me, I would make it worth your while.\
\
'Avanc are a good place to start. They are dangerous to be sure, but slow and simple creatures. Hunt them in the marshes near Loeglond, and find their leader, Fenskin. Beware of his powerful bite.'","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.","Defeat Fenskin","Defeated northern river-avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3939]={"'Next, I suggest you track down the notorious chicken-thief, Snowfell the Lynx. She is quite the successful hunter, with many children. Unfortunately for her, Lynx furs are quite valuable, and the people of Dale would like to keep their chickens. She will be harder to find than Fenskin, but the pay is good.'","Defeat mountain lynxes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Rékar","'It seems that crafty cat has finally met its match! Good work. Ready for your next challenge?'","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Mountain lynxes and Snowfell can be found on the slopes of Erebor.\
\
You should hunt mountain lynxes and Snowfell.","Defeated Snowfell","Dangerous Game: Lynx","Defeat Snowfell","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.","Defeated mountain lynxes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3940]={"Dangerous Game: Moose","Defeat Dale-lands moose (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Rékar","Rékar the Huntsman can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Rékar.","Dale-lands Moose and Oakthorn can be found in the wilderness near Dale.\
\
You should hunt Dale-lands Moose and Oakthorn.","Defeat Oakthorn","Defeated Oakthorn","'Many people underestimate the Moose. It is a large plant-eater lacking intelligence. Do not be fooled. An angry bull moose is a threat to any grown man or woman. One especially large moose, Oakthorn, has been known to even charge at caravans as they travel along the roads! See if you can hunt him down.'","Rékar the Huntsman has challenged you to bring down some well-known beasts in the Dale-lands.","'Excellent work! Glad to see you were not stomped to bits and gored by that monster's rack. I have one more challenge for you, if you are prepared.'","Defeated Dale-lands moose (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3941]={"Find a man dressed in yellow in the Court of Larinâsta","Read the note in the mysterious book on the table","Dangerous Pages","Tarsâri have appeared! Fight or flee from them!","Read the note in the mysterious book in the Kalmakhíla.","'I mean you no harm... currently.\
\
'Our lady has been watching you. You are curious about the Tarsâri. The Tarsâri are curious about you as well. We always have need of someone with your skill in execution.\
\
'Don't go far - I may have work for you - and answers to your questions.'","Locate the red book 'A History of Zajâna' in the south wing of the Kalmakhíla in Zajâna.","'There is much to learn in the Kalmakhíla. You wish to learn more about the Tarsâri? Yes, I believe there is an early history of Zajâna that touches on their lineage and formation.\
\
'Look for the book 'A History of Zajâna'. It should be in the south wing of the Kalmakhíla, a great red book in the second set of shelves. If you retrieve it, I will show you the section referencing the Tarsâri.'","Find a man dressed in yellow in the Court of Larinâsta in Zajâna.","You have heard the Kalmakhíla is a vast repository of knowledge. Perhaps there are books on the Tarsâri here?","Locate the red book 'A History of Zajâna'","Flee from the Tarsâri and return to Rayíka just outside the Kalmakhíla.","The note reads: You wish to learn more about the Tarsâri? Find me in yellow in Larinâsta","Flee from the Tarsâri and return to Rayíka!"},
[3942]={"Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the gwiber-nests.\
\
You should return to Frithgeir and let him know that you have been able to defeat a number of gwiber in Thrór's Coomb.","Several clutches of gwiber have begun to build nests in the valley of Thrór's Coomb below Zudrugund, endangering the people of Enedwaith.","'Your efforts have been valiant, but I fear these creatures will not be so easily driven forth.'","Defeat gwiber near gwiber-nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","'Gwiber are a breed of drake found specifically in this region. They used to dwell deeper in the mountains, but now they have descended into the vale.'","'Surrounding several rocky crags, a horde of gwiber has begun to populate the eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb. These creatures are growing in power and represent a danger to all of the people of Enedwaith.\
\
'We will pay well for any assistance that you might render in stemming the growth of the gwiber population.\
\
'Travel south across the river to the tundra below and seek out the gwiber along the eastern ridgeline of Thrór's Coomb.'","Dangerous Quarry","Gwiber-nests can be found in the eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb, south of Zudrugund.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to defeat any gwiber that you encounter near their nests."},
[3943]={"'${PLAYER}? I suppose I should thank you for the timely rescue, but I might have been better off if you had left me to my fate.\
\
'I must now live with the shame of defeat at the hands -- or branches, I suppose -- of that...that tree! It is a stain upon the honour of my family name that shall never be removed.\
\
'Ah well. Armund did not believe a word of it. There is some small consolation in that, I guess.'","Darfi, yet another companion of Armund, has disappeared somewhere to the north-west of the old sawmill in the Limlight Gorge. Armund asked him to scout the dense stands of trees near the base of the ridge there, but he still has not come back.","'Darfi is the finest woodcutter I know. That dwarf could chop down an old oak in five minutes flat, I tell you.\
\
'I sent Darfi out to survey some stands of old oak off to the north-west a bit, but that should not have taken but a little while, so I am afraid something is holding him up.\
\
'Maybe he spotted some ore up in the cliffs or some such. I need him back here so I can get his thoughts on our prospects in the Gorge.'","You freed Darfi!","Rescue Darfi","'Have you found Darfi yet?'","Talk to Darfi","Darfi Has Wandered Off","You should find Darfi the dwarf and help him get back to the mill.\
\
Armund said he was headed north-west of the sawmill to size up some lumber-stands for cutting.","You should speak with Darfi at the Limlight Gorge sawmill.","'Darfi is a fool.'"},
[3947]={"'¿Entonces la infestación ha empeorado? Si no se la contiene, estas arañas podrían multiplicarse y poner en peligro a todos los Valles de los Fuertes. Ya es bastante grave tener cosechas enfermas y animales agresivos. Nada de eso importará si toda esta tierra queda invadida por esta infestación.\
\
'Debes encontrar a la reina araña tomada por la sombra y derrotarla.'","Nuddo debe oír sobre la creciente infestación. Nuddo Sutchic está esperando en Lintrev.","Nuddo ha sido testigo de la presencia de la sombra en los alrededores.","Has derrotado a la reina araña corrompida.","Internándose en Hondonada del Terrón","Has derrotado a la reina araña corrompida.\
\
Debes contarle a Nuddo en Lintrev las buenas noticias.","Arañas de Hondonada del Terrón derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Nuddo Sutchic","Derrota arañas en Hondonada del Terrón (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las arañas se descontrolarán y causarán caos si no se las detiene.'","Nuddo te dice que las arañas han comenzado a atacar desde que la sombra atravesó la tierra. Hondonada del Terrón se encuentra al suroeste. Puedes tomar el camino que sale hacia el sur desde Lintrev y cruzar el puente.\
\
Viaja a Hondonada del Terrón y contiene la infestación de arañas.","'Gracias por compartir tu historia conmigo. He sido testigo del paso de jinetes negros por estas tierras y de un velo de sombra que los acompañaba.\
\
'Ha tenido un efecto terrible sobre la tierra. Todas las arañas de Hondonada del Terrón han caído en el caos. He estado trabajando junto a mi amiga Coruwen para enfrentar la fuerza corruptora de la sombra.'","Habla con Nuddo","Derrota a la reina araña corrompida.","'Hondonada del Terrón se encuentra al sur de aquí, cruzando el puente.'","Nuddo Sutchic te ha encargado encontrar y derrotar a la reina araña corrompida.\
\
Regresa a Hondonada del Terrón hacia el suroeste y encuentra a la reina.","'Gracias por derrotar a la reina araña. Eso debería frenar su proliferación hacia los Valles de los Fuertes, al menos por ahora.\
\
'Pero esto es solo el comienzo. Debemos encontrar una solución más permanente para hacer retroceder a la sombra. Aún tenemos algo de margen para respirar.'"},
[3948]={"Collect trophy-bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated goblins at Târ-kútoz and Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'If King Thráin means to bolster us only with a single warrior, I hope he has chosen wisely!'\
\
King Usk stares you down, and then chuckles to himself.\
\
'I welcome any aid you would give us, Longbeard. After all, Vélat and his Zhélruka have spun enough tales to last three wars, but if we intend to rout our foes, someone must do the fighting. A-ha!\
\
'Among the Orcs at Atrad-zarakh, their smaller cousins have proven difficult to overcome. Between the bat-tenders and those wielding their crude explosives, it has made our approach much more challenging than I had hoped.\
\
'Do what you can, and that is enough!'","Defeat bats at Târ-kútoz and Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hoping to put an end to Azog's plots at the warding-spire of Atrad-zarakh, Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu have made for the slopes of Bundushâthur.","You raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin in defiance of Azog!","'Yes, Longbeard? Do you bring word from King Thráin?'\
\
King Shâlim Nightcloak looks to you. You inform King Shâlim that you have come to aid the dwarves on Bundushâthur.\
\
'At least someone means to do what must be done then! I grow tired of these Zhélruka and Kámbrada. Not their warriors, mind you, but Usk and Vélat. For dwarves I thought to be sworn enemies, they seem to grow closer friends with each passing hour. That is all well and good, but it seems they have forgotten there is a war to be won!\
\
'The Abnúzhu have slain many Orcs this day, and we will slay many more before its end. I would not leave this battle empty-handed, friend. Orc-bones can make for fine trophies!'","Scout Târ-kútoz","'What do you say, Hermáth? The journey will be long, but hardship has not stopped us yet!\
\
'Will you aid our kin and cousins at Ashmargathâl?'","King Shâlim Nightcloak, King Usk, and King Vélat can be found at Ashmargathâl.\
\
You have arrived at Ashmargathâl. You should speak to the Kings of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu leading the assault on Atrad-zarakh.","Collected trophy-bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have done much to aid the dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu at Atrad-zarakh.","'What is this? Does King Thráin not trust us in our task?'\
\
King Vélat smirks.\
\
'I jest, Longbeard! Between the Zhélruka and the Abnúzhu, we have things well in hand. Oh, and I must admit that my friend, Usk, and his Kámbrada have played a part in our success as well. Hah!\
\
'Ashmargathâl was an easy prize to win, but Atrad-zarakh still teems with our foes. It would be far easier to look ahead without those accursed bats flitting about our heads!'","Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu can be found at Ashmargathâl, far to the north of Amdân on the slopes of Bundushâthur.\
\
Dáin has asked you to travel to Ashmargathâl and aid the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ.","Defeat goblins at Târ-kútoz and Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dark Clouds on Bundushâthur","Defeated bats at Târ-kútoz and Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to King Shâlim Nightcloak","Talk to King Usk","You have done much to hinder Azog's forces at Târ-kútoz and Atrad-zarakh.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh.","Târ-kútoz can be found to the west of Ashmargathâl.\
\
The Kings of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu have asked you to scout Târ-kútoz and defeat Azog's forces at Atrad-zarakh.","Goblins and bats can be found at Târ-kútoz and within the warding-spire of Atrad-zarakh. Trophy-bones can be collected from Orcs and some goblins.\
\
You should aid the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu by defeating the goblins and bats dwelling at Târ-kútoz. You should also collect trophy-bones for the Haban'akkâ.","Bats swirl around the Orcs and goblins encamped at the warding-spire of Atrad-zarakh","Completado","Although the battle on Bundushâthur is not yet ended, your efforts have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu.","Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh","Talk to King Vélat","Travel to Ashmargathâl","The Dwarves of the Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu have claimed Ashmargathâl!"},
[3950]={"Dark Deeds in Sammath Gûl","Collected Blades of Necromancy (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Laegalar has asked you to collect Blades of Necromancy from the Black Númenóreans that inhabit Sammath Gûl.","Collect Blades of Necromancy (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sammath Gûl is in Dol Guldur.\
\
Laegalar has asked you to recover many Blades of Necromancy from the Black Númenóreans who roam Sammath Gûl."},
[3951]={"'Los Orcos no son nada bueno, de eso no hay debate, pero algunos Orcos son peores que otros. Garthar y yo tuvimos algunos problemas con un tipo brutal de Orco hace poco tiempo. No le dimos importancia en ese momento, ya que vencimos al enemigo, pero resultó ser poderoso... mientras estaba solo. No puedo imaginar que su poder disminuya en absoluto en una multitud.\
\
'Estos Orcos usan las sombras de la mina contra ti. Ten cuidado cuando luches contra ellos, pero lucha contra ellos sin embargo, y cuando los hayas vencido en la bóveda, vuelve aquí a hablar conmigo.\
\
'El Tesoro Olvidado se encuentra a un buen viaje hacia el sur y el sureste de nuestra ubicación aquí en el Descenso Profundo. Hazte un favor, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}: no viajes dentro del lugar ${PLAYERNAME:solo[m]|sola[f]}.'","El Descenso Profundo de Moria se encuentra al norte y noroeste del Tesoro Olvidado.\
\
Has encontrado y eliminado a un buen número de los profanadores oscuros que merodeaban por el interior del Tesoro Olvidado.","Habla con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","'¡Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}! Cuantos menos Orcos tengamos que tratar, mejor. Khazad-dûm estará libre de esta horrible infestación rápidamente, a este ritmo.\
\
'Tus esfuerzos serán recordados por el Pueblo de Durin.'","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, una cámara sellada que oculta una considerable cantidad de riquezas. Este hallazgo ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos, que ahora desean descubrir la cámara y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores.","'¡Buen trabajo derrotando a esos malditos profanadores!'","Derrota a los profanadores oscuros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Deambular por aquí y hablar conmigo no va a reducir la población de profanadores sombrios. Será mejor que reúnas amigos y te dirijas a la sala al tesoro olvidada tan pronto como puedas.'","Profanadores Sombrios","Los profanadores oscuros se pueden encontrar dentro del Tesoro Olvidado, al sur y sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Falgir te pidió que encontraras y cazases a los profanadores oscuros que vigilan a los nuevos habitantes del Tesoro Olvidado."},
[3952]={"'Circulan rumores de que eres de una estirpe más dura que la mayoría, ${CLASS}. Admito que tienes aspecto de ser recio, y en tus ojos arde una ferocidad mayor que en muchos que he visto. Tal vez seas capaz de enfrentarte a un enemigo de enorme dificultad que amenaza nuestra causa.\
\
'Se murmura que un ser Sin Nombre habita en las profundidades de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas. Nadie se atreve a viajar hasta allí, pues todos temen hacerlo, pero aquí estás tú, invicto y orgulloso. Te propongo el mayor de los desafíos que puedo ofrecer: ¿te enfrentarás al Gurvand?\
\
'Y aun así, meramente enfrentarse al Gurvand sería poca cosa para alguien tan formidable como tú, ${CLASS}. Si logras derrotar a este enemigo Sin Nombre sin la ayuda de las runas de su estancia, aceptaré que eres tan gran guerrero como todos dicen. Sin duda te ganarás mi favor si consigues esta hazaña, y te otorgaré una recompensa valiosa a tu regreso triunfal. Deberías llevar contigo compañeros de corazón firme en esta empresa.'","En las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, las profundidades más olvidadas de Khazad-dûm, los Sin Nombre dominan las sombras amargas. Al igual que otras criaturas que se ocultan en la Fosa Negra que es Moria, los Sin Nombre temen la luz, pero no dejan pasar ninguna oportunidad de propagar corrupción y desaliento. Estos terribles enemigos deben ser erradicados de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas antes de que logren extenderse a otras zonas de las minas.","'¡Estoy tremendamente impresionado! Has hecho verdadero honor a tu fama. Sin embargo, algo sigue inquietándome. He escuchado tu descripción de este enemigo; el Gurvand parece ser un ser retorcido, más allá de la comprensión tanto tuya como mía.\
\
'¿Crees que el Gurvand ha desaparecido para siempre? Sé que lo viste derrotado, pero mi corazón me dice que no tardará en regresar. Una criatura tan antigua y corrompida no suele caer definitivamente tras una sola derrota. Hazme caso: volverá a causarnos problemas.'","No seas derrotado","La región de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas se extiende muy al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Sigurd te ha desafiado a internarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y derrotar al Gurvand sin la ayuda de runas, deseando que demuestres tu valía como el gran guerrero que se rumorea que eres.","Has sido ${PLAYERNAME:derrotado[m]|derrotada[f]}","Gurvand derrotado","Excavaciones Tenebrosas - Envueltas en tinieblas","Regresa con Sigurd a la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Derrota al Gurvand sin utilizar las piedras rúnicas","Sigurd se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Excavación donde merodean los Sin Nombre.\
\
Sigurd querrá saber si estuviste a la altura del desafío que te propuso: acabar con el Gurvand sin utilizar las runas.","'¿Has derrotado al Gurvand? ¿No? ¡Entonces te sugiero que tú y tus amigos os pongáis a ello!'"},
[3953]={"'Tráeme la lengua del Gurvand desde las Excavaciones Tenebrosas. Puedes llegar a ellas viajando muy al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.'","'¡Así que tú eres ${CLASS:el poderoso[m]|la poderosa[f]}  del que todo el mundo habla tan bien! Los rumores sobre tu valor y coraje han llegado a mis oídos, pero como soy de naturaleza escéptica, me gustaría comprobar si estás ${CLASS:hecho[m]|hecha[f]} para el tipo de desafío que tengo para ti.\
\
'Muchos de nosotros evitamos las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, donde deambulan los Sin Nombre. Si de verdad eres todo lo que dicen, irás allí y te enfrentarás a la criatura que mora en el corazón de las excavaciones: el Gurvand. Quiero que derrotes a esa cosa y me traigas su lengua como prueba de que ha muerto.\
\
'No será una tarea sencilla, pero tampoco es imposible. Siempre puede haber ayuda para quien la busque. Demuéstrate en este desafío que te propongo y recibirás una generosa recompensa. Ah, y… no hay ninguna deshonra en llevar amigos contigo en esta empresa.'","Lengua del Gurvand obtenida","El Gurvand se encuentra en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, muy al sureste del puesto de Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Eilíefr te ha desafiado a internarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y derrotar a la antigua criatura sin nombre conocida como el Gurvand, trayendo de vuelta su lengua como trofeo cuando hayas terminado.","Recoge la lengua del Gurvand","Muestra la lengua del Gurvand a Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","En las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, las profundidades más olvidadas de Khazad-dûm, los Sin Nombre gobiernan sobre las sombras amargas. Como otras criaturas que se esconden en la Fosa Negra que es Moria, los Sin Nombre temen la luz, pero no dejarán escapar ninguna oportunidad de propagar corrupción y desesperación. Estos terribles enemigos deben ser erradicados de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas antes de que consigan abrirse paso hacia otras zonas de las minas.","'¡Un magnífico trofeo! Aquella bestia era una criatura miserable y me alegra saber que ha desaparecido de una vez por todas.'\
\
De pronto, Eilíefr da un salto y profiere un grito alarmado.\
\
'¡La lengua! ¡Se ha movido! ¡La cosa vil aún se retuerce! No creo que el Gurvand esté realmente muerto…'","Excavaciones Tenebrosas - No hables mal"},
[3954]={"Regresa con Geirr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","En las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, las profundidades más olvidadas de Khazad-dûm, los Sin Nombre gobiernan sobre las sombras amargas. Como otras criaturas que se esconden en la Fosa Negra que es Moria, los Sin Nombre temen la luz, pero no dejarán escapar ninguna oportunidad de propagar corrupción y desesperación. Estos terribles enemigos deben ser erradicados de las Excavaciones Tenebrosas antes de que consigan abrirse paso hacia otras zonas de las minas.","'Tu fama se ha extendido por estos largos túneles, . Sí, deja de lado la modestia; puedo ver en tu ojos la mirada brillante de ${PLAYERNAME:un aventurero[m]|una aventurera[f]} valiente. Reconocería a los de tu clase incluso sin que los rumores me lo confirmaran.\
\
'¿Te apuntas a un pequeño reto? Al sureste de esta sala se encuentran las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, un lugar aterrador al que nadie se atreve a acercarse. Allí yace una maldad sin nombre, que se gesta en la oscuridad, corrupta, perversa y despreciable. Muchos pasos y extraños sonidos resuenan desde las Excavaciones. Creo que ya sabes de lo que hablo. Has visto a los enemigos sin nombre, ¿verdad?\
\
'${PLAYERNAME:Un aventurero[m]|Una aventurera[f]} como tú no dudaría en aceptar un simple desafío como el que te voy a proponer: ve a las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y mata a muchos enemigos. El miedo no te impedirá adentrarte en un lugar del que los demás huyen. Quiero que los Sin Nombre sean aniquilados, pues sería terrible que se propagaran por las minas.'","'No sé qué criaturas infestan las Excavaciones Tenebrosas, pero suponen una amenaza para todos nosotros.'","'Seré honesto contigo: no estaba seguro de que estuvieras a la altura de este desafío. ¡Pero me alegro de haberme equivocado esta vez! Perdóname por no haber confiado más en ti, ${PLAYER}, pues los rumores sobre tu valentía eran más que ciertos.\
\
'Aquí tienes una muestra de mi agradecimiento. Espero verte más a menudo en los próximos días, puesto que eres de gran ayuda para nuestra causa.'","Enemigos derrotados en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota enemigos en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Excavaciones Tenebrosas - Iluminar la Oscuridad","Las Excavaciones Tenebrosas están muy al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
El enano Geirr te ha retado a adentrarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y derrotar a muchos de los enemigos sin nombre que allí habitan.","El enano Geirr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Excavación, donde merodean los Sin Nombre.\
\
Geirr querrá saber si has sido lo bastante valiente como para adentrarte en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas y pelear contra los Sin Nombre."},
[3955]={"Es un tiempo de malos presagios. Los Heraldos de los Muertos han surgido de las sombras para amenazar a los pueblos de la Tierra Media, pero ¿qué mal los ha llamado?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando finalice el evento asociado.</rgb>","Nedda Hojapino se encuentra en los campamentos de Escaramuzas de Bree, Ost Galadh y la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Los Heraldos de los Muertos han aparecido en escaramuzas por toda la Tierra Media. Deberías buscar a Nedda Hojapino para saber más acerca de estos misteriosos enemigos.","Habla con Nedda Hojapino en Bree, Ost Galadh o en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Te has encontrado con una criatura de mal agüero, distinta a cualquiera de los lugartenientes del Enemigo a los que te hayas enfrentado antes. ¿Qué presagia su presencia para los pueblos de la Tierra Media?","Presagios Oscuros","'¿Sí? ¿Qué quieres?'\
\
Le explicas que encontraste una criatura de mal agüero en una escaramuza reciente.\
\
'¡No hables tan alto de ellas!'\
\
Nedda Hojapino mira a su alrededor y luego reduce la voz a un susurro.\
\
'Al principio pensé que no eran más que un cuento de un hobbit chiflado sobre criaturas descomunales de las Quebradas de los Túmulos, pero desde entonces me he enfrentado a suficientes de ellas en batalla como para saber que no es así. No sé de dónde han salido, pero dondequiera que van, los Muertos las siguen. He oído historias sobre estos heraldos de los Muertos en muchas tierras, y he viajado lejos para encontrarlos. Parece que se sienten atraídos por lugares de grandes batallas... por tierras donde se han librado muchas escaramuzas.'\
\
'Tu reputación me es conocida, ${PLAYER}, igual que tus hazañas. Yo digo que trabajemos juntos para enviar a estos heraldos de los Muertos de vuelta de donde vinieron.'"},
[3956]={"Rescued first kidnapped resident","Rescued fourth kidnapped resident","Rescue second kidnapped resident","'You found them all. That is welcome news indeed! Those people owe you their lives. Be careful, I shall soon have to make a song for your deeds, ${PLAYER}! Thank you for your brave deeds, my friend.'","Dark Hearts and Shadowed Minds","Defeated All-seeing cultists in Kûr Anzar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat All-seeing cultists in Kûr Anzar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mizâdi has asked for your aid in freeing kidnapped Urmâkhi residents in Kûr Anzar.","'I am Numûru, pleased to meet you outsider. I am the sworn protector and Hand of the Queen, leader of the deadly Subuzûri and — if you ply me with enough wine — singer of songs of Mizâdi's deeds and battles from Urmâkh to the Khûd. But that can wait for happier times, friend.\
\
'I have an urgent matter with which I'd ask your help. Scouts of the All-seeing have been pressing closer and closer to Urmâkh. We captured five this week alone. Regrettably, we missed a raiding party this morning. They made off with several innocent residents of Urmâkh, no doubt to torture them for information on our plans and defences.\
\
'You have proven quite resourceful in accomplishing much for Hamât, and Mizâdi. She has placed her trust in you multiple times, and you haven't let her down. I've been watching you quite closely, friend. This is a mission of great import. I believe you are skilled enough to accomplish what few others could. Please, go to Kûr Anzar, find where they have taken those Urmâkhi citizens, free them, and defeat any Barkhûshim that get in your way. You are the best hope those people have to return safely to Urmâkh, so please, go quickly.'","Rescued third kidnapped resident","Rescued second kidnapped resident","Rescue third kidnapped resident","Rescue first kidnapped resident","Return to Numûru in Urmâkh","Return to Numûru in Urmâkh with your report.","Numûru has tasked you with freeing kidnapped Urmâkhi residents in Kûr Anzar and defeating any All-seeing who stand between you and them. Kûr Anzar is located due east of Urmâkh.","Rescue fourth kidnapped resident"},
[3957]={"'¡Me alegra tu victoria, ${PLAYER}! Sabía que tenía razón al confiar en ti. Los Trév Duvárdain seguramente verán que has hecho lo que ellos debieron hacer y sentirán remordimiento por su fracaso.'","Guerreros Tarkrîp derrotados en Bûrzum Pushdug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cazadores Oscuros","Hostigadores Tarkrîp derrotados en Bûrzum Pushdug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La cueva de Bûrzum Pushdug está al norte de Tór Gailvin, en el lado oeste de la colina donde se construyó esa fortaleza. Tór Gailvin está al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
Finnán te pidió que derrotaras a los orcos de Bûrzum Pushdug para enviar un mensaje de reproche a los Trév Duvárdain.","'¡Los orcos de Bûrzum Pushdug no te olvidarán, ${PLAYER}, ni yo tampoco!'","Finnán cree que eres ${PLAYERNAME:digno[m]|digna[f]} de confianza y que puedes ayudar a los Trév Gállorg a combatir a los orcos de Bûrzum Pushdug.","'¡Salve, ${PLAYER}, matador de orcos!'","Derrota a los hostigadores Tarkrîp en Bûrzum Pushdug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los Trév Duvárdain de Tór Gailvin han sido negligentes, ${PLAYER}, y han permitido que los orcos se reúnan en la cueva de Bûrzum Pushdug. Ambos son vecinos, y esto me llena de ira, ¡como llenaría a cualquiera que lo oyera!\
\
'Has aceptado derrotar a los orcos de Bûrzum Pushdug, y espero noticias de tu éxito. La cueva está en el lado oeste de la colina donde se construyó Tór Gailvin, al noreste de Aughaire. Uno o dos aliados serán de ayuda, pues la cueva es peligrosa y está llena de orcos.'","'Crannog es el cacique de Aughaire, y tiene razón al desafiar a los forasteros a demostrar su valía. Pero yo, Finnán, siempre me he enorgullecido de mi buen ojo y mejor juicio. Sé que eres de fiar y que traerás gloria a los Trév Gállorg de Aughaire.\
\
'Ya te has aventurado en la fortaleza de Tór Gailvin, al noreste de este asentamiento, y has tomado los premios de los Trév Duvárdain; los traidores seguramente lamentarán su pérdida y se preguntarán si su lealtad fue entregada demasiado rápido a los salvajes gobernantes de estas tierras. Pero su traición va más allá de la avaricia, pues una tribu de orcos está acuartelada en la cueva de Bûrzum Pushdug, justo al norte de Tór Gailvin. ¡Los Trév Duvárdain tienen a estos orcos como vecinos, y esta es una traición tan baja que ni siquiera su avaricia puede justificarla!\
\
'Viaja a Bûrzum Pushdug con uno o dos aliados y mata a los orcos allí para recordar a los Trév Duvárdain lo que harían si fueran dignos de caminar por la tierra de sus padres. La cueva está en el lado oeste de la colina donde se construyó Tór Gailvin, al noreste de Aughaire.'","Derrota a los guerreros Tarkrîp en Bûrzum Pushdug (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Finnán está en la isla central del asentamiento de Aughaire.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos orcos en Bûrzum Pushdug y ahora deberías llevar la noticia de tu victoria a Finnán."},
[3958]={"The slopes of Gathbúrz are dotted with horrific idols of the Dark Lord Sauron. These must all be destroyed if the Elves are to reclaim the forest of Mirkwood from the clutches of the Enemy.","'The idols of the Necromancer are a foul sign of Sauron's power in Southern Mirkwood and the corruption of Greenwood the Great...it will be worth the risk only to destroy these dark signs.'","Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
Having destroyed many of the idols of the Necromancer, you should return to Handelen.","'As you have no doubt noticed, there are signs of the Enemy everywhere upon this hill, most notably the evil idols they raise to their Dark Lord in Mordor.\
\
'In time, it is our hope to cleanse this land of the Orc-presence altogether, but in the meantime we shall begin with those symbols of the Dark Lord's power here, for they cast an oppressive pall over this place that we must work to banish.\
\
'When you have destroyed the idols, return here to me.'","Idols of the Necromancer may be found across the landscape of Gathbúrz.\
\
Handelen has tasked you with destroying the dark idols of Sauron that stand as a symbol of his power of Southern Mirkwood.","Dark Idols","Destroy dark idols in Gathbúrz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The dark idols have been destroyed? Good. There may be little light in this place until Dol Guldur itself is reduced to rubble, but at least we need no longer look upon the leering visage of our Enemy at every turn as we do battle for the fate of Mirkwood.'","Destroyed dark idols in Gathbúrz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3960]={"Hostigadores Ongbúrz derrotados en Morfil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Morfil está en Fasach-larran, al este de Aughaire. Allí encontrarás a los orcos que mataron a mis hermanos, y allí debes ir.'","Capitán Ongbúrz derrotado en Morfil","Derrota al capitán Ongbúrz en Morfil","'Te agradezco en nombre de mis hermanos, ${PLAYER}, por la muerte de muchos orcos.'","'Mis hermanos eran grandes guerreros y obtuvieron mucho honor en batalla contra los Trév Duvárdain y los orcos de Angmar. Todos hablaban bien de ellos, y tanto mujeres como hombres los llamaban poderosos.\
\
'Pero incluso el hombre más fuerte puede caer por una sola flecha disparada desde las sombras, y así fue con mis hermanos. Los orcos los atacaron en la cueva Morfil y fueron derrotados.\
\
'He pedido a Crannog venganza, y ahora él ha decidido enviarte a ti contra los orcos en mi lugar. ¡Espero que seas digno, porque si tu fuerza no es suficiente, te irá mal! La entrada a Morfil está en Fasach-larran, al este de Aughaire. Derrota orcos dentro y alrededor de la cueva y haz que paguen por la muerte de mis hermanos.'","Guerreros Ongbúrz derrotados en Morfil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Jinetes Oscuros","Derrota a los hostigadores Ongbúrz en Morfil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los hermanos de Torquil fueron asesinados por orcos, y él busca aliados para vengarse de ellos.","'Mis hermanos estarían complacidos por tu servicio en su honor, . Te doy las gracias en su nombre por haber matado a los orcos en Morfil.\
\
'Por mi parte, creo que eres ${PLAYERNAME:digno[m]|digna[f]} de confianza. Pero le corresponde a Crannog decidir sobre este asunto.'","'¡Los orcos no olvidarán pronto la venganza de Torquil y ${PLAYER}!'","Derrota a los guerreros Ongbúrz en Morfil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La cueva Morfil está en Fasach-larran, al este de Aughaire.\
\
Torquil te ha pedido que vayas a Morfil y derrotes a los orcos que mataron a sus hermanos.","Torquil está en Aughaire, cerca del asiento de Crannog, al oeste de la isla central del asentamiento.\
\
Has matado a muchos orcos en Morfil y ahora deberías regresar con Torquil en Aughaire."},
[3961]={"Found the accursed staff","Find the accursed dagger","YOU SHOULDNT SEE THIS","'When I was spying on those ruins to the south-east, I saw a number of sorcerers wielding accursed relics in rituals meant to draw these fell spirits to Taur Morvith.\
\
'I have seen three such accursed relics. A dagger, a cup, and a staff. The dagger and cup are held in the ruins themselves, but I was unable to find where the staff is kept. I believe that one of the sorcerers must carry it upon his person?\
\
'If you could sneak in and lay your hands upon these accursed items, it might prevent them from summoning more fell spirits, which would be a great relief to us.'","Dark Relics","Found the accursed dagger","Find the accursed staff","'Recover the implements of the sorcerers' foul rituals, ${PLAYER}. A stop must be put to their evil.'","Ianudirel can be found just south of the bridge at Krul Lugu.\
\
You should return the accursed relics you have gathered to Ianudirel.","The dagger and cup are held in the ruins of Sâd Morangol. The staff may be carried by one of the sorcerers of Sâd Morangol.\
\
Ianudirel has asked you to collect three relics -- a dagger, a cup, and a staff -- from the sorcerers of Sâd Mornagol.","Find the accursed cup","'You found all of the relics? Well done!\
\
'I will return these to Ost Galadh as soon as I am able. Agorin will properly dispose of them.'","Found the accursed cup","Ianudirel has discovered the location of a number of evil relics being wielded by the sorcerers in Taur Morvith to summon fell spirits.","Bring the relics to Ianudirel"},
[3962]={"Gwyllion's Gate lies to the south of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Rhiain has asked you to seek evidence of the Cuthraul's presence and to banish the spirit if you may.","You feel an unnatural chill in the air","You found the evidence Rhiain requires","Talk to Rhiain at Gavar Cadlus","'Grufudh says that your friends sent medicine and furs for trade... it is a good demonstration of trust, but our trust is not so easily earned. Too much dwells in this land that we do not understand... many evil spirits.\
\
'Just last night, I was seeking a lost goat and saw what I believe was a Cuthraul, an evil spirit, floating in the air near Gwyllion's Gate. The Old Woman of the Mountain who lives beyond that pass is a strange creature, so the sight of such a spirit was not surprising, but I fear its presence.\
\
'Will you seek evidence that what I saw was not just my imagination? If the Cuthraul appears, will you be able to banish it? Gwyllion's Gate lies south from here. I have only seen the spirit at night.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Some creatures may only be found at night; however, the first stage of this quest may be advanced during the day.</rgb>","Rhiain is at Gavar Cadlus, north from Gwyllion's Gate.\
\
You should return to Rhiain with tidings of your success.","Cuthraul have appeared at Gwyllion's Gate, to the south of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Rhiain sked you to banish the Cuthraul if you can.","Defeated Cuthraul in the Windfells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Cuthraul in the Windfells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Uch-lûth received the gift of the Grey Company, but still do not trust you fully.","Dark Spirits of the Windfells","'Our legends tell that the Cuthraul haunt places where someone died violently... you are brave to go to those places and face the evil!'","Seek evidence of the Cuthraul at Gwyllion's Gate","'You are glûs -- holy -- Duvodiad! None of our folk have ever been able to banish the Cuthraul... we praise you, Glûs Duvodiad!'","'It is said the blood of the innocent draws the Cuthraul like moths to a flame... who died in these lands, I wonder?'","'The Cuthraul are fearsome spirits of folktales... now they are come to life!'"},
[3963]={"Defeated Cuthraul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cuthraul haunt the lands around Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Iuan has asked you to banish the Cuthraul from the land.","'I do not know how you are able to banish these spirits, Glûs Duvodiad, but for it, we praise you in song!'","Dark Spirits of the Windfells -- Repeatable","Iuan is at Gavar Cadlus in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should return to Iuan with tidings of your victory against the Cuthraul.","'${PLAYER}, Glûs Duvodiad! We beseech you to aid us once more. Your power against the Cuthraul is great, but more have been seen haunting the lands!\
\
'Will you seek out these fell spirits and banish them as well? I fear they will possess our goats and call forth Druggavar!'","'You are the bane of the Cuthraul, Glûs Duvodiad.'","Defeat Cuthraul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Iuan at Gavar Cadlus","The Uch-lûth were impressed by your victory against the Cuthraul at Gwyllion's Gate and seek your aid once more."},
[3964]={"Camran se encuentra en la isla central de Aughaire, al este del asiento de gobierno de Crannog.\
\
Has destruido los estandartes que volaban sobre Tor Gailvin y deberías volver ahora a Camran.","'Conozco tu prueba, ${PLAYER}, y estoy preparado para hacer mi parte.\
\
'Ya has estado en la fortaleza de Tor Gailvin, el hogar que los Trev Duvardain recibieron de sus nuevos amos, el mal que se sienta en Carn Dûm. Raith cree que arrebatar los símbolos del Enemigo a los Trev Duvardain de Tor Gailvin es suficiente; yo no estoy de acuerdo.\
\
'Vuelve a Tor Gailvin, al noreste de Aughaire, y destruye los estandartes que vuelan sobre sus muros. Esto enviará un mensaje claro a los Trev Duvardain y a sus amos. Estoy seguro de ello. Si haces esto, le contaré a Crannog la historia de tu éxito.'","Estandartes Oscuros","Camran de Aughaire te ha preparado una tarea por la que sabrá si tienes la confianza de Crannog.","La fortaleza de Tor Gailvin se encuentra al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
Camran te ha pedido que vuelvas a Tor Gailvin y destruyas los estandartes que vuelan sobre la fortaleza.","Destruye los estandartes de Tor Gailvin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los Trev Duvardain no olvidarán pronto tus hazañas en Tor Gailvin.'","'Has vuelto ${PLAYERNAME:vivo[m]|viva[f]} de Tor Gailvin, y me alegra verlo. ¿Los estandartes ya no vuelan sobre la fortaleza? Le contaré a Crannog tu victoria sobre los Trev Duvardain, pero por mi parte estoy satisfecho y te llamo ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.'","'Vuelve a Tor Gailvin, la fortaleza al noreste de Aughaire, y destruye los estandartes que vuelan sobre ella. Si eres capaz de hacer esto, le informaré a Crannog de tu éxito.'","Habla con Camran","Has destruido los estandartes de Tor Gailvin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Domongart no podrá mantener Tor Gailvin para siempre.'"},
[3966]={"Los orcos Nûlthauk y Ranghâsh están en la ciudad de Dûn Covád, lejos al norte de Aughaire, entre las colinas occidentales.\
\
Eilig te ha pedido que derrotes a uno de los dos orcos que mataron a su hermana y así vengar su memoria.","'Los orcos no mantendrán Dûn Covád para siempre.'","'Que los orcos tiemblen al oír el rumor de nuestros pasos.'","Eilig, un guerrero de los Trév Gállorg, busca sembrar el caos entre los orcos que han tomado la ciudad de Dûn Covád y vengar a su hermana también.","Eilig está en el Búth Luikh de Aughaire.\
\
Deberías regresar con Eilig y contarle tu viaje a Dûn Covád.","'Los orcos Nûlthauk y Ranghâsh están en la ciudad de Dûn Covád, lejos al norte de Aughaire, entre las colinas occidentales. ¡Derrota a uno de ellos y me habré vengado de ambos!\
\
'Lleva uno o dos aliados contigo, pues la ciudad es muy peligrosa y mis enemigos no lo son menos.'","'¡Hemos luchado contra los Trév Duvárdain y contra los orcos, y seguiremos haciéndolo hasta que seamos derrotados o los expulsemos de nuestras tierras!\
\
'Al norte de Aughaire, los orcos han tomado la antigua ciudad de Dûn Covád en las colinas occidentales. Conozco a dos de sus líderes: Nûlthauk y Ranghâsh. Si logras derrotar a uno o a ambos, sus filas podrían caer en el caos.\
\
'Pero eso es secundario para mí. Hace varios meses, estos orcos formaban parte de la banda que mató a mi hermana Mairád. Si matas a uno de ellos, el otro sabrá que mi venganza se acerca, tarde o temprano. Eso será suficiente para mí. Lleva uno o dos aliados, pues la ciudad es oscura y está llena de peligros.'","Venganza oscura","'Me alegra tu victoria en mi nombre, ${PLAYER}. Has traído mi venganza contra quienes habitan Dûn Covád. ¡Que el otro tiemble y se pregunte cuándo le llegará mi venganza!'"},
[3967]={"'¡Tu determinación nos ha ayudado a cambiar el rumbo, ! Cuando llegaste, estábamos sitiados por enemigos por todos lados, pero ahora... ¡ahora somos nosotros quienes estamos haciendo retroceder a nuestros enemigos! Me atrevo a decir que nuestra victoria en la recuperación del Camino de Durin está prácticamente asegurada, y tú has jugado un papel importante en ello.\
\
'Hay otros enanos en Khazad-dûm que necesitan más ayuda que nosotros. Simbi, en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, ha pedido que te enviemos a él. Buena suerte, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. No olvidaremos tu valentía.'","Habla con Simbi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Victoria Oscura","Simbi está de guardia en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al sur de Jazârgund. \
\
Simbi ha enviado un mensaje a Oxi, pidiendo hablar contigo en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","Oxi cree que tus esfuerzos han mejorado enormemente la situación en el Camino de Durin desde tu llegada. Cree que la victoria está asegurada para los enanos en Jazârgund, pero que otros lugares en Moria pueden necesitar tu ayuda.","'${PLAYER}! No llegas ni un momento tarde, he estado esperando tu llegada.\
\
'Oxi dice que las cosas van bien en el Camino de Durin, pero no se puede decir lo mismo de todo Khazad-dûm.'"},
[3968]={"Encuentra el segundo cadáver de trasgo","Gyrgir está en la Bodega Putrefacta, en el noreste de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Gyrgir estará encantado de escuchar que las sanguijuelas ya no representarán un problema para los enanos.","Las sanguijuelas se amontonan alrededor de los cadáveres de trasgos justo al oeste de la Bodega Putrefacta.\
\
Gyrgir quiere que encuentres los cadáveres de los que se han estado alimentando las sanguijuelas y esparzas toxina de tritón alrededor de ellos para matar a las sanguijuelas.","'¿Así que lo esparciste por todas partes donde viste sangsues? Excelente. Espero que pronto sea seguro explorar de nuevo.'","'No voy a volver a las orillas. No después de lo que me hicieron esas sanguijuelas la última vez. Tengo una solución que creo que las eliminará, pero no voy a probarla.\
\
'Si quieres ir a verter esto en el agua, siéntete libre de hacerlo. Hay cuatro lugares que son particularmente malos, todos cerca de cadáveres de trasgos. Esos cadáveres son probablemente su principal fuente de alimento, cuando no pueden encontrar mis piernas.\
\
'Dirígete justo al oeste. Encontrarás el agua infestada de sanguijuelas justo debajo de la Bodega Putrefacta.'","Usa la toxina de tritón","Ves algunas sanguijuelas arrastrándose en el agua","Toxina de tritón utilizada","Encuentra el primer cadáver de trasgo","'No podemos explorar las aguas con todas esas sanguijuelas. Lleva la solución a los lugares donde se reúnen y viértela en el agua.'","Encuentra el tercer cadáver de trasgo","Encuentra el cuarto cadáver de trasgo","Habla con Gyrgir en la Bodega Putrefacta","Aguas Oscuras y Poco Profundas","Las sanguijuelas que infestan las Obras Hidráulicas se han salido de control y están impidiendo que los enanos exploren más allá."},
[3969]={"'Usa el ácido en el espejo. Si Ansurr tiene razón, debería limpiar el hongo de él.'","Espejo limpiado con el ácido","Habla con Thrand en Hulwul-nefekh","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYER}!\
\
Uno de los espejos de los enanos ha sido cubierto por el hongo que infectaba todo aquí abajo. No importa lo que haya intentado, no he podido deshacerme de él. Ansurr ha estado experimentando con una variedad de ácido que dice haber recuperado de los dragoncillos en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata... quizás podrías intentar usarlo para limpiar el espejo.\
\
El espejo está al sur, justo afuera de la Cámara de la Memoria. Si funciona, regresa a verme, pero viaja con cuidado, ¡los Orcos están al acecho! ¡Aún hay más por hacer!'","¡Los Globsnaga se apresuran a reclamar el espejo!","Thrand está en Hulwul-nefekh en el centro de las Obras Hidráulicas.","'Entonces, ¿lo limpiaste? Bien. Es interesante que los Orcos se hayan enfurecido para defenderlo así.'","El espejo cubierto de hongo se encuentra justo afuera de la Cámara de la Memoria, al sureste de Hulwul-nefekh.\
\
Thrand cree que el ácido que Ansurr fabricó debería destruir el hongo que cubre el espejo.","Encuentra el espejo cubierto de hongo","Oscurecido por el moho","Limpia el espejo con el ácido","Antiguos espejos reflejaban la luz a lo largo de los túneles de Moria. Uno de ellos, que se encuentra en las Obras Hidráulicas, está completamente cubierto por una gruesa capa de hongo."},
[3970]={"Los aguaoscuras están en los estanques y jardines de Glinghant, más allá de la plaza de Clorhir.\
\
Debes entrar en Glinghant y derrota a los aguaoscuras que han profanado su belleza.","Aguaoscuras derrotados en Glinghant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Glinghant fue una vez el lugar más bello de todo Annúminas... algo nada fácil dado el esplendor de la antigua ciudad en su apogeo. Las descripciones de los estanques y jardines de Glinghant tienen un lugar especial en los corazones de mi gente. Incluso después de tantos años de deterioro, podía contemplarse el recuerdo de su belleza.\
\
La llegada de Amarthiel y sus legiones a Annúminas es de por sí motivo de tristeza, pero de todo el daño que han causado a la ciudad, el ocupamiento y profanación de Glinghant es lo que más me enfurece. Aunque el resto de Annúminas cayese, los expulsaría de este lugar y restauraría su esplendor de antaño. No muchos de mis hermanos comparten esta opinción, pero tal es mi horror por la profanación de Glinghant.\
\
Amarthiel tiene muchos siervos, pero a Glinghant ha enviado a los aguaoscuras: espíritus malvados de corrupción. Si te aventurases más allá de las puertas a las terrazas de Glinghant, te agradecería enormemente que los eliminases.","La más oscura de las aguas","Derrota a los aguaoscuras en Glinghant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[3971]={"Herehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of Fangorn.\
\
You should return to Herehasen and let him know that the Black Huorns will not threaten the Men of Rohan, and Blackthorn the Ent has pledged his allegiance to them.","Blackthorn has been roused to wrath by the treachery of Saruman.","'Little ${RACE}, I was already angered by the encroachment of the burárum...from my northern home, I saved a Man from his walled city when the Orcs destroyed it. Hoom, Béortnoth, I believe his name was.\
\
'Now, I can see what evil Saruman has truly come to. Ta-rum! You may return to the Men of the lands beyond and tell them that Blackthorn of Fangorn shall fight! Look for my emissary at their village in the ruins...I will come if you send him.'","DNT -- Will not be seen","Darkness No More","Talk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp","'Walking trees and Ents? Are you mad? No one would believe such a ridiculous tale.\
\
'Ah well, perhaps I was wrong about the shadows in the trees....'"},
[3972]={"The Ent Blackthorn was roused to anger by your reckless slaughter of his Huorns.","Herehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of the eaves of Fangorn.\
\
Blackthorn sent you back to Herehasen with his refusal to help the Rohirrim.","Your carelessness in slaying the Huorns who serve Blackthorn has likely cost the Rohirrim a powerful ally. You should speak with Blackthorn and try to convince him to help.","Darkness No More","Blackthorn has chosen to ignore the needs of the Rohirrim, but at least you can assure Herehasen that the shadows of Fangorn will not harm his people.\
\
You should speak with Blackthorn before returning to Herehasen.","Talk to Blackthorn","'You are reckless, little ${RACE}. Hoom, you have slaughtered Huorns both friendly and corrupted without regard to their nature. Perhaps I was hasty to save young Thane Béortnoth...the people of Rohan are violent and savage.\
\
'Return to your folk and tell them that the forest will not harm them, but neither will it help. Ta-rum! Go now!'","Your carelessness in slaying the Huorns has likely cost a powerful ally. You should speak with Blackthorn and try to convince him to help.","Talk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp","'Walking trees and Ents? Are you mad? No one would believe such a ridiculous tale.\
\
'Ah well, perhaps I was wrong about the shadows in the trees....'"},
[3973]={"Herehasen is at Tordag's camp in the Broadacres, south of Fangorn.\
\
You should return to Herehasen and let him know that the Black Huorns will not threaten the Men of Rohan, and Blackthorn the Ent has pledged his allegiance to them.","Blackthorn has been roused to wrath by the treachery of Saruman.","'Little ${RACE}, I was already angered by the encroachment of the burárum...from my northern home, I saved a Man from his walled city when the Orcs destroyed it. Hoom, Béortnoth, I believe his name was.\
\
'Now, I can see what evil Saruman has truly come to. Ta-rum! You may return to the Men of the lands beyond and tell them that Blackthorn of Fangorn shall fight! Look for my emissary at their village in the ruins...I will come if you send him.'","DNT -- Will not be seen","Darkness No More","Talk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp","'Walking trees and Ents? Are you mad? No one would believe such a ridiculous tale.\
\
'Ah well, perhaps I was wrong about the shadows in the trees....'"},
[3974]={"'My scout entered the cave and reported foul chanting deep within. When he ventured further into the cavern, he saw several dark figures overseeing a grisly ritual behind a locked gate.\
\
'You should try to unlock the gate and disrupt the ritual.'","Below Drug Haniad, within an abandoned crypt, resides the source of the darkness creeping into the Lich Bluffs.","Mincham's camp lies in a small grove of trees, north of Drug Haniad.\
\
You should return to Mincham and inform him that the ritual has been stopped and that a greater force is behind the raising of the wights in the Lich Bluffs.","Talk to Mincham in the Lich Bluffs","Talk to Mincham  in the Lich Bluffs","'Beneath Drug Haniad lies an ancient crypt that appears to be the cause of the darkness that is growing in the southern Lich Bluffs. One of our scouts recently reported seeing a crude entrance dug into the ground there, and from within he heard dark chanting.\
\
'Could you seek out the entrance to this barrow and disrupt whatever foul ritual is taking place down below? If so, speak with me again.'","'I am glad to see that you were able to disrupt that grisly ritual. From what I understand, the body that was on the table was a new vessel for Ferndúr the Virulent. \
\
'I fear that, unknown to us, one of the Lords of the Gauntmen settled here some time ago and has been using the barrows of the Lich Bluffs to raise wights for an army of his own.\
\
'Thank you for disrupting the ritual, as it may have well saved the lives of the entire Grey Company and many of the men and women that call this land home.'","Mincham is at his camp in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should speak with Mincham when you are prepared, and he will lead you to the entrance of Lhe Colvern.","Darkness Revealed"},
[3976]={"'If you have a moment to spare, I must ask for your help in these dark times. Three days ago a man from the north came through this town with an army of warriors and ghosts. If you do not believe me, I understand, but I assure you I speak the truth.'\
\
You say you know of this man and that his name is Aragorn, son of Arathorn.\
\
'Yes, I think I recall someone saying that name. I did not know this man but many in town did or were persuaded by his words and joined him on his eastern march. He took many and the rest stayed in their homes out of fear. After this frightful army of Men and Dead left the vale, the sky grew dark and rumours spread of Trolls lurking in the woods. Three days have passed and many still say they've seen The Dead wandering through the trees.\
\
'Borhador, the lord of the Vale, rests in his hall. Much has left his realm in these recent days, including his hope. Perhaps an outsider such as yourself, spending some time in the Vale, will give Borhador strength to lead his people again.'","'I have nothing to say to you, stranger. Leave me be for my days are numbered.'","Borhador can be found in The Crossing-hall.\
\
You should speak with Borhador.","Speak with Borhador","Darkness over Ethring","Candúr, the town guard, asks you speak with Borhador of the situation in the Vale.","Borhador carries the heavy burden of uncertainty for his Vale."},
[3977]={"Edwulf can be found at the Rohirrim training grounds, east of Cliving. The camp is a converted farmstead, hidden in a vale of trees north of the road.\
\
Reeve Athelward has asked you to speak with Edwulf, the man in charge of instructing his daughter, Ides, in the martial arts.","Talk to Edwulf at the Rohirrim training grounds","Daughter Like Father","Athelward's beloved daughter, Ides, has aspirations of becoming a brave warrior, much like her father. Athelward wishes for Ides to be happy and has agreed to provide her with suitable training.","'I have a personal matter that I feel can be entrusted to you. The second eldest of my daughters, Ides, has aspirations of becoming a shield-maiden, following in the reputation of her father as a great warrior. I love Ides dearly and wish her to be happy, so I have arranged for her to receive training in preparation for becoming a shield-maiden.\
\
'I have seen your experience and talent when it comes to matters of prowess. Would you be willing to mentor Ides, oversee her training, and ensure that she is happy and free from danger? If you are able to assist her, please speak with her trainer, Edwulf. You will find him at the secluded training grounds east of Cliving, north of the vale of trees along the road.'","'The training grounds of the Eorlingas are no place for a young woman, such as Ides. When she becomes injured -- or possibly worse -- it will be my head that Reeve Athelward will be after! \
\
'If you are here to help keep her safe, then I welcome your aid, but please refrain from encouraging her foolish ambitions of becoming a shield-maiden. If the Norcrofts is to be saved, it will not be by foolhardy women.'"},
[3978]={"'Hoom. Little one... I find that the Men outside the forest either say too much or far too little. So, which is it for you? Too little then, I suppose. We shall see if that does not change... for a great many things have changed here.\
\
'The forest has not been chilled such before. Yes, we have had winters, and the cold does yet come, but this... this goes far beyond a simple changing of the seasons. When Tithenolf and I awoke, nothing was as I remembered it. There were times when I and the other Ents conversed at length, for there was much still to say, and even more time to say it. But now... the Enting Hollow has frozen solid, our enemies set siege to the forest, and Leaflock slumbers, unable to tend the Huorns.\
\
'Ah, to be free of such problems... and to think of better times....'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Days Long Past","Talk to Barallas to hear more of his tale","Barallas is at Stonecliff with Tithenolf in northern Balewood.\
\
Barallas wishes to tell you more of the Ents of the Balewood. You should speak with him to learn more of his tale.","'Duskleaf was right, ${PLAYER}. I knew my mistake well once Núrzum carved his path under the canopy. I still hold out hope that the forest may be reclaimed, dim as it may be. The Men and their horn have paled in comparison to such wanton destruction.\
\
'Aside from Tithenolf, I have not seen the others since awakening. I cannot help but wonder what has become of them. I worry greatly for Duskleaf... he is quick to action, and if he dared stand against Núrzum, I fear what horrors might have befallen him.\
\
'If you would, let us talk of finding the others. It may be that you find such eagerness to aid us misplaced... or perhaps not. We shall see, little one....'","Talk to Barallas","'Come, we must travel to the Enting Hollow. Are you ready to follow, little one?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","The Ent, Barallas, wishes to share his memories of the Balewood before Núrzum's assault shattered the forest.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Barallas is at Stonecliff with Tithenolf in northern Balewood.\
\
Barallas has finished his tale. You should now speak with him and discover if more can be done to aid the Ents."},
[3979]={"The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.","'Dead? I don't believe you. He was fine just a moment ago!\
\
'You just don't know how to talk to him, here let me try again!'","'...'\
\
This avanc has clearly reached the end of its days. It is a wonder that Rook has not realized this yet. Perhaps the best thing would be to tell Rook the truth.","This avanc is clearly dead, but its rider has no idea","'Puzzling... very puzzling, indeed. You should give him a good talking to, perhaps I was too gruff with him earlier.\
\
'Yes, that will surely work. Just make sure you get his attention first, he can be very easily distracted.'","The avanc lays motionless on the ground","As Rook's avanc is his steed of sorts, whistling might be a good way to call him.\
\
The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.","Whistling didn't prove helpful, so perhaps a more direct approach would work.\
\
The avanc can be found under Rook to the west of Snowbourn.","Poke at the avanc","Attempt to speak to the avanc","Rook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.","Dead In His Tracks","The avanc lays still","Rook is getting extremely frustrated that his avanc will not rise and continue on their journey.","Whistle and try to grab the avanc's attention","Talk to Rook"},
[3985]={"Con la terrible presencia de los tumularios, los montañeses de Rhudaur y la amenaza de las aguas oscuras, el enemigo se ha vuelto demasiado poderoso como para que el pequeño campamento de Eglan pueda contenerlo.","Ve a ver a Eriac el Fuerte al campamento de Eglain, en Agamaur.","Hay tumularios por todo Agamaur.\
\
Eriac te ha pedido que le ayudes a matar tumularios en Agamaur. Los Eglain no son lo suficientemente numerosos como para luchar solos contra estas temibles criaturas.","Tumularios derrotados en Agamaur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Eriac el Fuerte se encuentra en el campamento de Eglain, en Agamaur.\
\
Has eliminado a un gran número de tumularios en el Pantano Rojo. Ahora es el momento de volver a ver a Eriac el Fuerte para informarle.","Derrota tumularios en Agamaur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La resurrección de los muertos","'Saber que has eliminado a tantas criaturas me devuelve la esperanza de recuperar algún día estas tierras, tal y como predijo la sombra Dannasen.\
\
'Has demostrado tu valía, ${PLAYER}, y los Eglain te estarán eternamente agradecidos.'","'La sola existencia de estas criaturas basta para inspirar miedo, pero lo que más me aterroriza es su número. No podremos expulsarlas para siempre, necesitamos ayuda para evitar que infesten nuestras tierras.'","'${PLAYER}, no somos suficientes para combatir todos los peligros que nos acechan. Cualquier ayuda será bienvenida... Ya has apoyado mucho a los Eglain, y espero que sigas haciéndolo.\
\
'En la parte occidental de estas tierras abundan criaturas muertas hace mucho tiempo que merodean por las ruinas...\
\
'Es el instinto de supervivencia lo que me impulsa a pedirte ayuda, no el miedo. Estas criaturas deben ser eliminadas. Dirígete al pantano situado al noroeste y elimina a los tumularios que encuentres allí; también hay algunos al este.'"},
[3986]={"Las Aguasombrías","'Tu presencia es bienvenida, ${PLAYER}. Me temo por la seguridad de los míos. Los ancianos que trajiste para ayudarnos se lanzan al combate contra el enemigo en su esfuerzo por encontrar a la Doncella Roja de la que hablan, pero no pueden contener la gran marea por sí solos.\
\
'En las regiones orientales de Agamaur, el agua misma ha surgido, como si hubiera cobrado vida propia. Criaturas de agua, a las que llamamos Aguasombría, nos atacan sin previo aviso. No sé cómo es posible luchar contra las aguas del pantano, pero me gustaría que lo intentaras.\
\
'Al salir de las profundidades, arrastran consigo antiguas piezas del Rhudaur y del Arthedain. Tráeme estas piezas como prueba de tus esfuerzos.'","'¡Bien hecho, ${CLASS}! Gracias por hacer esto. Ahora puedo descansar un poco más tranquilo, pero aún queda mucho trabajo por hacer.\
\
'Estas piezas también ayudarán a los míos a sobrevivir, pues pueden tener valor para los Hombres de Bree. Ahora tengo algo más que pedirte...'","Piezas antiguas recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las Aguasombrías se encuentran en el extremo este de Agamaur.\
\
Eriac te ha pedido que ayudes a los suyos a repeler a estas entidades formadas a partir de las aguas de Agamaur. Como prueba de tus esfuerzos, quiere que le traigas las antiguas piezas del Rhudaur y del Arthedain que quedan atrapadas en las Aguasombrías cuando estas surgen de los pantanos.","Con la terrible presencia de los tumularios, los montañeses de Rhudaur y la amenaza de las Aguasombrías, el enemigo se ha vuelto demasiado grande para que el pequeño campamento de Eglain pueda contenerlo.","Recupera piezas antiguas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Devuelve las piezas a Eriac","'¿Me has traído las piezas? Me hacen falta lo antes posible. Por favor, date prisa. Dirígete hacia el este para encontrar las Aguasombrías.'"},
[3987]={"Habla con Thettmár en el Descenso Profundo","Usa el pasadizo secreto cerca de Stíling","'Los trasgos de Gamil Filik caerán pronto, gracias a tus esfuerzos.'","Vuelve con Stíling (puedes usar el pasadizo secreto)","Thettmárr se encuentra en el campamento de Descenso Profundo, al norte de Gamil Filik.\
\
Deberías volver con Thettmárr y contarle lo que has visto en el campamento de los trasgos.","La trampa de caída mortal se encuentra cerca del campamento de los trasgos en Gamil Filik, al sureste del campamento de Descenso Profundo.\
\
Stíling te ha pedido que encuentres la trampa de caída mortal y la actives, para luego atraer a Pukhlor hacia su muerte bajo las rocas.'","¡La trampa está colocada!","¡Pukhlor ha caído!","Arma la trampa y atrae a Pukhlor hacia ella","Caída mortal","Stíling señaló una antigua trampa de caída en las minas, construida por los enanos de Moria hacía mucho tiempo, y sugirió que podrían aprovecharla en beneficio de los enanos.","Stíling está en su puesto, a las afueras de Gamil Filik.\
\
Deberías volver con Stíling y contarle que Pukhlor ha sido derrotado.","'Así que Pukhlor yace en una tumba de piedra. Ojalá eso les recuerde a los trasgos a quién pertenece realmente Khazad-dûm.\
\
'No me importa qué señores malvados los apoyen, los propios cimientos de Khazad-dûm se levantan contra ellos.'","El pasadizo secreto está justo al lado de Stíling, en la sala cercana a Gamil Filik.\
\
Debes entrar en el pasadizo secreto para colarte por detrás del campamento de los trasgos.","'¿Entonces nuestros vecinos trasgos no nos causarán problemas en el futuro? Es una noticia estupenda, ${PLAYER}. Gracias por ayudar a Stíling en Gamil Filik.'","'Exploré este pasadizo secreto mientras tú distraías a los trasgos dentro de Gamil Filik, y me complace informar de que es seguro. Nos lleva a un túnel muy cerca de Pukhlor, que parece ser un enemigo aterrador, como nunca había imaginado.\
\
'Pero hay buenas noticias: creo haber visto un trozo de roca suelta que serviría como una buena trampa para acabar con Pukhlor. Si te cuelas por detrás a través de este pasadizo oculto, creo que podrás atravesarlo y aplastar a ese villano atrayéndolo hacia la trampa.'"},
[3990]={"'As I feared, my father spoke true of Ungwetári's children. If her spiders come now to the gates of Durthang, they fear no counter-strike from Ugrukhôr or any others of the Gúrzyul. Even the deceptions of the Enemy could not sway them into his service, and now that Sauron has fallen, nothing remains to restrain them from hunting their prey.\
\
'I think it unwise to remain still in Lhingris overlong, and so I believe we should travel into Rath Cail and seek shelter amongst the Morgai.\
\
'When you are ready, we will depart.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You will swiftly travel into Rath Cail with Legolas when you accept this quest.</rgb>","Talk to Legolas in Rath Cail","Legolas can be found atop a small ridge overlooking Rath Cail.\
\
You have travelled into Rath Cail with Legolas and should now speak to him.","'Ah, this will do. I suppose it is no worse than anywhere else in the hills of the Ephel Dúath....'\
\
Legolas peers into the distance, silently observing Rath Cail.\
\
'This vale is swarming with foes, but I fear we must pass through it.'","Deadly Stillness","Legolas fears that remaining still in Lhingris portends an ill fate, and so he hopes to move deeper into Rath Cail to continue his search for Ungwetári."},
[3991]={"Darkwater drawn from the river Blackroot by Azruthor threatens people throughout the vale and could soon wash over all of Gondor.","Deadly Torrents","Defeated darkwater in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Melril","Darkwater can be found in and along the river Blackroot in Tarlang's Crown\
\
Melril has asked you to quiet the waters of the Blackroot which have been roused by Azruthor in Tarlang's Crown.","'After you aided him, Gordir spoke to us of such unbelievable things... so unbelievable, in fact, that it was difficult for any of us to make sense of what he was saying.\
\
'We all understood soon enough... we saw the waters of the Blackroot rise against us, brought to form by some fell power. They rise from the water and just as swiftly fade back into it, but they have terrified all who have laid eyes on them.\
\
'They roam the river's edge even now, ${PLAYER}... quiet them and perhaps more of our people will be bold enough to come to our aid!'","DNT -- will not be seen","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}, I can see the unease fading from my fellows already.\
\
'Yet, I still fear that as long as this Heir lurks in the Crown, we will not soon see the last of them.'","Defeat darkwater in Tarlang's Crown (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Melril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have quelled the darkwater and returned it to the river Blackroot. You should now speak to Melril."},
[3992]={"The Orc falls defeated!","Challenge and defeat Captain Róglarg's warriors in Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deadly or Dead","You signal the Orc that you are prepared.","At Captain Róglarg's urging, Shíkurz has assembled his warriors to be tested against your skill in combat.","'Well, I guess that settles it. The tarks would have had no trouble slaying them!\
\
'I'll tell Captain Róglarg that we'll need some better Orcs if we're to keep holding this damned Tower!\
\
'Your skill in combat is unusually potent as of late, Silent One. Keep it up!'","Captain Róglarg's warriors can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Shíkurz has asked you to test the warriors in Captain Róglarg's garrison. You are to challenge them and fight to the death.","'Hoi! Silent One!\
\
'Captain Róglarg's told me to test some of his new warriors against your skill in combat. Normally, it'd be a simple bit of sparring, but the Captain insists the fights be to the death!\
\
'I can't say I understand his thinking, but orders are orders! You know how that goes, losing your tongue and all....\
\
'The Captain wants you to try your hand against twelve, but let's just say I'll turn a blind eye and let you count each one as two. After all, I've got other things that need doing. You won't say anything, will you? Hah!\
\
'Right. I've got them lined up here in the courtyard. Challenge whichever ones you wish!'","Talk to Shíkurz in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol","Shíkurz can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have defeated many of Captain Róglarg's Orcs and should now return to Shíkurz."},
[3994]={"Completa la misión 'Asegurando el Agua'","'Tengo tres pupilos: Marget, Deryn y Murig. Son grandes estudiantes con mucho potencial. Aunque soy su maestra, tienen edad suficiente para asumir responsabilidades propias. Me gustaría que ayudaras a cada uno con una tarea en la que están trabajando. Creo que les será útil hacer de maestros por una vez.\
\
'Deryn es este muchacho inteligente justo a mi lado. Marget está más allá, en la zona principal de Cuencasangre. La última vez que la vi estaba tomándose un descanso tras derribar a unas cuantas bestias. Murig está cuesta abajo, junto al río.\
\
'¿Hmm? ¿Qué haré yo? He tenido una semana larga. Puede que vaya a dormir una siesta. ¿Has tenido que cuidar de tres niños en plena naturaleza durante una semana seguida? Eso agotaría a cualquiera.'","Tratando con Cuencasangre","Completa la misión 'Botánica Mórbida'","Completa la misión 'Pelea en la Cuencasangre'","Habla con Deryn","Marget, Deryn y Murig pueden encontrarse cerca de la guarida de Huargos conocida como Cuencasangre.\
\
Ayuda a cada uno de los alumnos con su tarea.","'${PLAYER}, ¿supongo que terminaste la tarea que Eluna te asignó? Hablando de nuestra querida instructora, ¿la has visto mientras nos ayudabas? Ya debería haber regresado hace bastante. Puede que sea una maestra poco convencional, pero es una excelente exploradora y guerrera. Me preocupa su ausencia sin explicación.'","Has ayudado a cada uno de los exploradores guerreros en entrenamiento y debes regresar a su campamento.\
\
Habla con Deryn","Deryn te hace señas para que hables con él","Eluna quiere presentarte a sus pupilos."},
[3995]={"'This fool threatened to shoot me with a crossbow if I did not turn over one of my eggs. As you can see, things did not proceed as he expected.'","Talk to Anath","Anath has asked you to meet Nekhama in Halrax.","While you were searching for Berkha, Itho arrived to try stealing one of Raghda-gûn's eggs for himself.\
\
Speak to Raghda-gûn's friends to discover the story of what transpired.","Talk to Nekhama in Halrax","The woman stands outside the pub looking impatient. She spots you, thrusts a letter into your hands, and returns inside. She does not invite you to follow her.\
\
The letter is written in shockingly beautiful handwriting:\
\
The would-be child thief has been dealt with. Before his demise, he mentioned the name of someone in Umbar who seeks rare 'animals' to own. If you find yourself in the city of Umbar, seek out Tatháta. She could be an ally in your hunt for this scoundrel.","Itho has arrived at Raghda-gûn's nest to take an egg for himself.","'Me? I'm an old friend of Raghda-gûn's here. I heard about this piece of flotsam asking around about roc eggs the other day. I didn't think much of it until one day I come out of the pub and he's not in his usual spot. Something feels wrong about it, so I gather Nekhama here–'\
\
Nekhama grunts.\
\
'–and I come to see Raghda-gûn. You know, just in case. Turns out we didn't have much to worry about here as this fool has as much sense as he does hygiene.'\
\
Nekhama grunts again, but this one sounds like it might have been a laugh.\
\
'Is he alive? He is, merely stunned by the thrashing we gave him. Hmm? Curious about who he meant to steal the egg for? Ah so are we. Tell you what, Nekhama here will carry this sea-sponge back to Halrax.'\
\
Nekhama grunts disapprovingly.\
\
'Meet her there later today and see if she hasn't learned anything. I'm going to stay a while longer and speak to my friend.'","Dealing with Itho"},
[3997]={"Talk to Vatnar to enter the cellars","Death From Below","Vatnar has detected a band of goblin-sappers digging a tunnel below the cellars of Thangúlhad. He and his brother Thyrnir intend to invade the goblin-tunnel and collapse it before they can undermine the tower's foundation.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>WARNING: Death From Below is a high difficulty solo challenge quest. Beware, all who enter therein.</rgb>","Vatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
With the aid of Vatnar and Thyrnir, you have defeated the goblin-sappers and saved Thangúlhad. You should speak again with Vatnar.","'That should be the end of the goblin-sappers. You have my thanks for your aid.\
\
'I wouldn't be surprised if they try again after they finish licking their wounds, but from what Rodelleth tells me, we will not be here much longer anyway.'","Talk to Vatnar at Thangúlhad","Vatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should speak with Vatnar when your are ready to travel with him and Thyrnir to prevent the goblin-sappers from destroying Thangúlhad.","'Let us hurry down to the cellars, and quickly, ${PLAYER}!'.\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>WARNING: Death From Below is a high difficulty solo challenge quest. Beware, all who enter therein.</rgb>","'I have ill news, ${PLAYER}. It seems that we've got a little vermin problem, if you will. I was minding my own business and taking a stroll through the cellars beneath this tower when I heard a bit of a noise.\
\
'Well, I put my ear to the rock for a quick listen, and what do you think I hear? Picks and shovels, ${PLAYER}, picks and shovels! What's more I could hear goblin voices muttering in Black Speech. It seems that a band of goblins has been set to work and mean either to bring down Thangúlhad around our ears or invade it from below.\
\
'Either way, we've got to stop them and quickly! My brother and I can deal with the goblins' works, but we'll need a stalwart companion to keep the vermin off of us while we're about our labours. What say you?'\
\
<rgb=#00ff00>WARNING: Death From Below is a high difficulty solo challenge quest. Beware, all who enter therein.</rgb>"},
}
